rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Any \'X\' in the creature\'s cost is treated as zero."}, {\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You don\'t pay any costs of that creature card, including additional costs."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you have four or fewer cards in your hand when Ivory Tower\'s ability resolves, the ability has no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "You can pay 0 life if you want, but it\'s not useful most of the time."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on a player with less than 2 cards in their library. It will remove 0 or 1 cards if that is all that is available.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is not a draw effect so it will not cause a player with less than 2 cards in their library to lose.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since you are putting more than one card in the graveyard at one time, the affected player can choose the order the 2 cards go in.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Howling Mine leaves the battlefield before it resolves, then the last known tap or untap state of the card is used for resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does not trigger at all if this is tapped at the start of the draw step, and it checks this again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional draw is separate from any other draw during your draw step. It happens when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The additional cost can be reduced by effects that reduce costs, such as Sapphire Medallion.\'}, {\'date\': \'2006-05-01\', \'text\': "In Two-Headed Giant, spells don\'t cost extra on your own turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "Effects that say the game is a draw, such as the _Legends_(TM) card Divine Intervention, are not affected by Platinum Angel. They\'ll still work."}, {\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': "You can concede a game while Platinum Angel on the battlefield. A concession causes you to leave the game, which then causes you to lose the game (Once you concede, you no longer control a Platinum Angel, so its ability can\'t prevent you from losing the game)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If you control Platinum Angel in a Two-Headed Giant game, your team can\'t lose the game and the opposing team can\'t win the game."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "No game effect can cause you to lose the game or cause any opponent to win the game while you control Platinum Angel. It doesn\'t matter whether you have 0 or less life, you\'re forced to draw a card while your library is empty, you have ten or more poison counters, you\'re dealt combat damage by Phage the Untouchable, your opponent has Mortal Combat with twenty or more creature cards in their graveyard, or so on. You keep playing."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Other circumstances can still cause you to lose the game, however. You will lose a game if you concede, if you\'re penalized with a Game Loss or a Match Loss during a sanctioned tournament due to a DCI rules infraction, or if your _Magic Online_(R) game clock runs out of time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-12-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact will trigger when Sculpting Steel enters the battlefield. Any "as enters the battlefield" or "enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen artifact will also work. For example, if Sculpting Steel copies an artifact creature with sunburst, the copy will get +1/+1 counters based on the number of different colors of mana used to pay Sculpting Steel\\\'s total cost. If Sculpting Steel copies a noncreature artifact with sunburst, the copy will get charge counters based on the number of different colors of mana used to pay Sculpting Steel\\\'s total cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen artifact is a token, your Sculpting Steel copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Your Sculpting Steel is not considered to be a token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': \'If the chosen artifact is copying something else (for example, if the chosen artifact is another Sculpting Steel), then your Sculpting Steel enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "Sculpting Steel doesn\'t copy whether the original artifact is tapped or untapped. It also doesn\'t copy any counters on that artifact, any Auras or Equipment attached to that artifact, or any effects that are currently affecting that artifact — you get exactly what\'s printed on the chosen card and nothing more. So if you copy an animated Chimeric Staff, for example, you get a normal, nonanimated Chimeric Staff."}, {\'date\': \'2007-07-15\', \'text\': "You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Sculpting Steel stays on the battlefield as an artifact that doesn\'t do much of anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'All your lands will have the chosen land type and no other land type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Changing a land\'s type doesn\'t change its name or whether it\'s legendary or basic."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'Lands you control will have the mana ability of the basic land type you choose (for example, Forests can tap to produce green mana) and will lose all other innate abilities they had.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If multiple Quietus Spikes trigger at the same time, that player loses half their life when the first ability resolves, then loses half of the remainder when the next ability resolves, and so on. The player does not lose the same amount each time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "That player loses half their life after combat damage has been subtracted from the player\'s life total. The amount of life the player loses is determined as the triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, after combat damage is dealt, Quietus Spike looks at that player\'s life total (which is the same as the team\'s life total) when determining how much life the team will lose, which basically means the team\'s life total is halved. Here\'s an example of the math: The team has 19 life, so the player has 19 life. Quietus Spike causes the team to lose 10 life (19 divided by 2, rounded up). The team\'s life total becomes 9 (19 minus 10)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The ability affects each spell that\'s not an artifact spell, including your own."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The ability affects the total cost of each nonartifact spell, but it doesn\'t change that spell\'s mana cost or mana value. The extra mana also doesn\'t change how many times you kicked the spell or what the value of X is (if applicable)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "When determining a spell\'s total cost, effects that increase the cost are applied before effects that reduce the cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined as the ability starts to resolve. If the targeted player has five cards in their graveyard at that time, for example, this ability will put five more cards into that graveyard from the top of that player\'s library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Any Golem that couldn\'t be targeted by the original spell (due to shroud, protection abilities, targeting restrictions, or any other reason) is just ignored by Precursor Golem\'s second ability."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery spell has multiple targets, but it\'s targeting the same Golem with all of them (such as Agony Warp targeting the same Golem twice), Precursor Golem\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Fireball does), the copies have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copies will have the same mode. Their controller can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The controller of the spell that caused Precursor Golem\'s second ability to trigger also controls all the copies. That player chooses the order the copies are put onto the stack. The original spell will be on the stack beneath those copies and will resolve last."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The copies that Precursor Golem\\\'s second ability creates are created on the stack, so they\\\'re not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (like Precursor Golem\\\'s second ability itself) won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The second ability triggers whenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell that targets only one Golem and no other object or player. That Golem can be Precursor Golem itself, one of the Golem tokens it created, or any other Golem. It doesn\'t matter who controls the Golem."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Becoming an artifact doesn\'t change what color(s) a permanent is."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'You may target any permanent with the ability, including an artifact.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal are card types.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Semblance Anvil can reduce the amount you pay for a spell\'s cost that includes {X}. For example, Blaze is a sorcery that costs {X}{R}. If the card exiled with Semblance Anvil is a sorcery, and you want to cast Blaze with X equal to 5, you\'ll have to pay only {3}{R}. This is true even if the ability states that {X} must be paid with a certain color of mana (as Drain Life does)."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Semblance Anvil takes the total cost to cast a spell into account, not just its mana cost. This includes additional costs (such as kicker) and alternative costs (such as evoke). It also includes cost increases from other sources (such as Lodestone Golem\'s ability)."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Semblance Anvil won\'t affect the part of a spell\'s cost represented by colored mana symbols. For example, a spell that normally costs {1}{U} to cast would cost {U} if it shared a card type with the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Semblance Anvil\'s cost reduction effect is mandatory."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Spells you cast that share multiple card types with the exiled card still cost just {2} less to cast. They don\'t get a greater cost reduction."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'It must be clear to all players which token has deathtouch and which token has lifelink.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'The two creature tokens enter the battlefield at the same time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Even if you control more than one Unwinding Clock, you\'ll only untap your artifacts once during each other player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Some effects, such as the one generated by Rust Tick\'s ability, state that an artifact doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s untap step. These effects won\'t apply and stop the artifact from untapping during another player\'s untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Those artifacts untap at the same time as the active player\'s permanents. You have no choice about what untaps and can\'t choose to not untap an artifact you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Pristine Talisman has a mana ability. Its ability doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "The ability will trigger when Ichor Wellspring is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, even if the ability that triggered when it entered the battlefield hasn\'t resolved yet."}]', "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The value of X is constantly updated as instant cards and sorcery cards are put into or removed from your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': \'If you choose 1 for the value of X, Astral Cornucopia will cost {3} to cast and enter the battlefield with one charge counter. If you choose 2 for the value of X, it will cost {6} to cast and enter the battlefield with two charge counters, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "The last ability is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "A creature attacks alone if it\'s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, Sigil of Valor\'s ability won\'t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Count the number of creatures you control other than the equipped creature as Sigil of Valor\'s ability resolves to determine the amount of the bonus. Once the ability resolves, the bonus won\'t change, even if the number of creatures you control does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If you reveal no land cards, Goblin Charbelcher deals damage equal to the number of cards revealed, and then you may order your library as you like.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "You must choose a target for Goblin Charbelcher\'s ability as you activate it, before you reveal any cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Activating Key to the City\'s ability targeting a creature that has already been blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Key to the City\'s last ability triggers during your untap step, but it\'s put onto the stack at the same time as abilities that trigger at the beginning of your upkeep step. Even though Key to the City\'s ability triggered first, you may order it before or after other abilities you control that are put onto the stack at this time."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can activate Key to the City\'s first ability without targeting any creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can pay {2} only once each time Key to the City\'s triggered ability resolves. You can\'t pay more to draw additional cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Aetherflux Reservoir\'s first ability doesn\'t trigger when you cast Aetherflux Reservoir itself."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The first ability counts spells you cast earlier in the turn even if you didn\'t control Aetherflux Reservoir as you cast them, and even if those spells were countered."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The first ability counts the spell that caused it to trigger plus any other spells you cast earlier in the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The number of spells you\'ve cast is counted only as Aetherflux Reservoir\'s triggered ability resolves. For example, if you cast a spell, then respond to the triggered ability with a second spell, you\'ll gain 4 life total."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If an artifact spell has {X} in its mana cost, choose the value for X first, and then reduce the cost by {1}. For example, an artifact that costs {X} with X chosen as 4 costs {3} to cast if you control Foundry Inspector.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced an artifact spell, no player may take actions to try to remove Foundry Inspector from the battlefield before that spell\'s cost is locked in."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Because improvise isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Equipment attached to a creature doesn\'t become tapped when that creature becomes tapped, and tapping that Equipment doesn\'t cause the creature to become tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with improvise will result in the artifact being tapped when you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for improvise. Similarly, if you sacrifice an artifact to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with improvise, that artifact won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for improvise."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you cast a nonartifact spell that requires you to sacrifice a permanent as an additional cost, you may tap that permanent (if it\'s an artifact) for the spell\'s improvise ability before you sacrifice it to pay that cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Improvise can\\\'t be used to pay for anything other than the cost of casting the spell. For example, it can\\\'t be used during the resolution of an ability that says "Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise can\'t pay for {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, {G}, or {C} mana symbols in a spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Improvise doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of improvise are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Tapping an artifact won\'t cause its abilities to stop applying unless those abilities say so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Improvise applies after the total cost is calculated."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "When using improvise to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell\'s total cost. Then you can tap artifacts you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Whir of Invention (a spell with improvise and mana cost {X}{U}{U}{U}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{U}{U}{U}. If you tap two artifacts, you\'ll have to pay {1}{U}{U}{U}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Scrap Trawler and another artifact you control are put into a graveyard at the same time, Scrap Trawler\'s ability triggers for each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If an artifact is a copy of another artifact with greater mana value, such as Sculpting Steel copying an artifact with mana value 4, Scrap Trawler\'s ability can target that artifact card in your graveyard when that artifact is put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The target artifact card must have a lesser mana value than the artifact that caused Scrap Trawler\'s ability to trigger by being put into a graveyard. Use the artifact\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield to determine what may be returned."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While on the battlefield or in a graveyard, {X} in an object\'s mana cost is 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Self-Assembler\'s ability can find any creature card with the Assembly-Worker subtype, not only creature cards named Assembly-Worker. Notably, it can\'t find Mishra\'s Factory."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If you control no legendary creatures or legendary planeswalkers, you can activate Mox Amber\'s ability, but you won\'t add any mana."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If your legendary creatures and legendary planeswalkers are all colorless, you can activate Mox Amber\'s ability, but you won\'t add any mana. Colorless is not a color."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Mox Amber\'s ability adds one mana of the color of your choice from among the colors of legendary creatures and legendary planeswalkers you control. It doesn\'t add one mana of each of those colors."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'"Equip [quality] creature" is a variant of the equip keyword. "Equip [quality] creature [cost]" means "[Cost]: Attach this Equipment to target [quality] creature you control. Activate only as a sorcery."\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Whether the target creature is legendary is checked only as Blackblade Reforged\'s first equip ability is activated and as that ability resolves. If the creature somehow becomes nonlegendary later, Blackblade Reforged remains attached to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any "as [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[this creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created that token."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Clone), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature leaves the battlefield before the triggered ability of Helm of the Host resolves, or if there is no equipped creature, no token is created. However, if Helm of the Host leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, a token will be created of the creature it last equipped. If that creature has also left the battlefield, its last known information is used to determine what the token looks like.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "The token gains haste indefinitely, and this effect isn\'t copiable. If something else copies the token later, that copy won\'t have haste."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'The token isn\\\'t legendary, and this exception is copiable. If something else copies the token later, that copy also won\\\'t be legendary. If you control two or more permanents with the same name but only one is legendary, the "legend rule" doesn\\\'t apply.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target player\'s library contains fewer cards than the sacrificed creature\'s power, all of those cards are put into that player\'s graveyard. That player won\'t lose the game until they try to draw from the empty library."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The number of cards the target player puts into their graveyard is equal to the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'Because you never "cast" a land card, Mystic Forge doesn\\\'t allow you to play an artifact land from the top of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library has a morph ability, you can cast it face down from the top of your library, even if it\'s normally not a colorless card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Mystic Forge lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction—see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the spells you cast from your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'You still pay all costs for a spell you cast from your library, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Mazemind Tome leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, you can\'t exile it from the zone it\'s put into."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Even though Adaptive Automaton is a Construct, other Construct creatures you control won\'t get +1/+1 unless you chose Construct as Adaptive Automaton entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Adaptive Automaton enters the battlefield. Players can\'t take any actions between the time the choice is made and the time the appropriate creatures begin to get +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can tap a creature that hasn\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began to activate Springleaf Drum\'s ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities are written in the form "Cost: Effect." Some keywords are activated abilities (such as equip) and will have colons in their reminder texts. Static and triggered abilities of sources with the chosen name are unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Phyrexian Revoker\'s ability affects sources with the chosen name no matter what zone they are in. For example, a cycling ability of a card with the chosen name can\'t be activated from hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Any creature can be equipped with Sword of the Meek, not just 1/1 creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Sword of the Meek can\'t be attached to the creature that caused its last ability to trigger, most likely because that creature has left the battlefield, Sword of the Meek returns to the battlefield and remains unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature is entering the battlefield under your control, consider static abilities to determine whether its power and toughness are both 1. Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can\'t be used to raise or lower the creature\'s power and toughness in time to have the last ability trigger or to stop it from triggering."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Once the last ability has triggered, changing the power or toughness of the creature won\'t stop you from returning Sword of the Meek and attaching it to the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Sword of the Meek\'s last ability triggers only if it\'s in your graveyard immediately after the 1/1 creature enters the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a land has more than one basic land type, it can be chosen more than once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If one of the basic land types isn\'t present, it isn\'t chosen. If the only land of a certain type is one you control, you must choose it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Players can\'t take actions in between the time you choose the lands and the time you destroy them. Notably, they can\'t activate mana abilities of those lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Sundering Titan\'s ability isn\'t targeted. When it resolves, Sundering Titan\'s controller must choose one land for each basic land type (Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest), and then they are destroyed simultaneously."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If permanents become untapped during the untap step, Mesmeric Orb\\\'s ability will trigger that many times. However, since no player gets priority during the untap step, those abilities wait to be put on the stack until the upkeep starts. At that time, any "beginning of upkeep" triggers will also trigger. Those abilities and Mesmeric Orb\\\'s triggers are put onto the stack at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast a colorless spell, Ramos\'s triggered ability triggers, but it won\'t get any +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ramos\'s triggered ability counts the number of colors a spell has (from zero to five), not how many colored mana symbols are there in its mana cost or how many colors of mana you spent."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ramos\'s triggered ability doesn\'t trigger until you\'ve finished casting a spell, including paying all of its costs. If Ramos has fewer than five +1/+1 counters on it, there\'s no way to add counters with a spell and pay for that spell with the newly-added counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ramos\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered. If that spell is countered, use its last known information to determine what colors it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Jalum Tome\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen in between, and no player can choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the cost of spells of the chosen type you cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as a flashback cost), add any cost increases (such as kicker costs), then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Cloud Key\'s ability). The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers from the resolution of an activated mana ability is also a mana ability. This means that if the land\'s ability that caused you to add mana was an activated mana ability, Caged Sun\'s triggered ability won\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abwicklungsuhr\', \'text\': \'Enttappe während des Enttappsegments jedes anderen Spielers alle Artefakte, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Hitze des rotierenden Mechanismus wird aufgefangen und in Energie umgewandelt, sodass das System dauerhaft funktionieren kann."\\n—*Ruskos Kompendium des Uhrwerks*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1e730e-74c1-4c2c-a79f-86d7f2b777a6\', \'multiverseId\': 587367}, \'multiverseid\': 587367}, {\'name\': \'Reloj desenredador\', \'text\': \'Durante el paso de enderezar de cada uno de los demás jugadores, endereza todos los artefactos que controles.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El calor del mecanismo giratorio se acumula y se convierte en energía, lo que le permite funcionar indefinidamente".\\n—*Compendio de relojería de Rusko*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce87f1ec-406c-4ecd-a322-9ea5132413ff\', \'multiverseId\': 587430}, \'multiverseid\': 587430}, {\'name\': \'Horloge débridée\', \'text\': "Dégagez tous les artefacts que vous contrôlez pendant l\'étape de dégagement de chaque autre joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La chaleur du mécanisme rotatif est capturée et convertie en énergie, ce qui lui permet d\'opérer à perpétuité. »\\n—*Précis d\'horlogerie de Rusko*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c8dcc2f-c87a-4eb2-ad7f-17025600d746\', \'multiverseId\': 587493}, \'multiverseid\': 587493}, {\'name\': \'Orologio a Scarica\', \'text\': \'STAPpa tutti gli artefatti che controlli durante lo STAP di ogni altro giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il calore del meccanismo rotante viene catturato e convertito in energia, permettendogli di operare con moto perpetuo."\\n—*Compendio Meccanico di Rusko*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c6eddd-8ab6-4152-b523-b681f2d4cbc2\', \'multiverseId\': 587556}, \'multiverseid\': 587556}, {\'name\': \'巻き戻しの時計\', \'text\': \'あなたでない各プレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップに、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「回転機構の熱を確保しエネルギーへと変換、永続的な駆動を可能とする。」\\n――*「ラスコによる機械仕掛け概要」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7153296-67e8-4512-a578-21983af85964\', \'multiverseId\': 587619}, \'multiverseid\': 587619}, {\'name\': \'Relógio Reversor\', \'text\': \'Desvire todos os artefatos que você controla durante a etapa de desvirar de cada outro jogador.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O calor do mecanismo giratório é capturado e convertido em energia, permitindo que ele funcione perpetuamente."\\n— *Compêndio de Maquinaria de Rusko*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca0edc3-b384-4044-86d9-39ea5dce4ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 587745}, \'multiverseid\': 587745}, {\'name\': \'松卷钟\', \'text\': \'于每位其他牌手的重置步骤中，重置所有由你操控的神器。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「捕捉回转装置产生的热量并将其转化为能源之后，就能让它永续运行。」\\n～*《鲁斯柯发条学纲要》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63544b8b-096e-4058-a7f5-4a723fa917c2\', \'multiverseId\': 587808}, \'multiverseid\': 587808}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abwicklungsuhr\', \'text\': \'Enttappe während des Enttappsegments jedes anderen Spielers alle Artefakte, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Partisanen haben ein seltsames Artefakt ausgegraben. Keiner kennt seinen Ursprung, aber es gibt ihnen die Hoffnung auf ein Leben danach."\\n—Elspeths Tagebuch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586674&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b617aee-e7c8-47bf-8533-1bcf0e441399\', \'multiverseId\': 586674}, \'multiverseid\': 586674}, {\'name\': \'Reloj desenredador\', \'text\': \'Durante el paso de enderezar de cada uno de los demás jugadores, endereza todos los artefactos que controles.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los partisanos han desenterrado un extraño artefacto. Nadie sabe su origen, pero les da esperanza de una vida en el más allá".\\n—Diario de Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9347ae0d-cd1d-496f-a24f-00811e83b097\', \'multiverseId\': 586737}, \'multiverseid\': 586737}, {\'name\': \'Horloge débridée\', \'text\': "Dégagez tous les artefacts que vous contrôlez pendant l\'étape de dégagement de chaque autre joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Les partisans ont découvert un étrange artefact. Personne ne connaît son origine, mais il leur donne l\'espoir d\'un au-delà. »\\n—Journal d\'Elspeth", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd0f3c8-b094-4ea7-bbfe-f3642209bae1\', \'multiverseId\': 586800}, \'multiverseid\': 586800}, {\'name\': \'Orologio a Scarica\', \'text\': \'STAPpa tutti gli artefatti che controlli durante lo STAP di ogni altro giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I fautori hanno dissotterrato uno strano artefatto. Nessuno ne conosce l\\\'origine, ma dà loro speranza per una vita successiva."\\n—Diario di Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c0ddf70-978f-43ab-9a04-20ed3c826fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 586863}, \'multiverseid\': 586863}, {\'name\': \'巻き戻しの時計\', \'text\': \'あなたでない各プレイヤーのアンタップ・ステップに、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのアーティファクトをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「非正規兵たちが奇妙な遺物を掘り出した。誰もその出自を知らなかったが、来世への希望を与えてくれる。」\\n――エルズペスの日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df21bd7f-2402-4e93-bf55-7c74a3e7d4ce\', \'multiverseId\': 586926}, \'multiverseid\': 586926}, {\'name\': \'Relógio Reversor\', \'text\': \'Desvire todos os artefatos que você controla durante a etapa de desvirar de cada outro jogador.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Os guerrilheiros descobriram um estranho artefato. Ninguém sabe sua origem, mas ele lhes dá esperanças de uma vida além."\\n— Diário de Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3eefc62-96ee-4b6c-ae12-7d01a383a6f9\', \'multiverseId\': 587052}, \'multiverseid\': 587052}, {\'name\': \'松卷钟\', \'text\': \'于每位其他牌手的重置步骤中，重置所有由你操控的神器。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「游击队挖出古怪的神器。没人知道其来源，但却给予他们往后生命的希望。」\\n～艾紫培的日志\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994563cc-e711-413d-8b1e-39bce2fa7598\', \'multiverseId\': 587178}, \'multiverseid\': 587178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar des Wahnsinns\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt so viele Karten, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Es geht nicht darum, dass du wahnsinnig wirst. Es geht darum, dass du darum betteln wirst, wahnsinnig zu werden."\\n—Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'151ed361-542d-444d-b6b7-0c5564fe7b34\', \'multiverseId\': 586616}, \'multiverseid\': 586616}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la demencia\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: El jugador objetivo muele una cantidad de cartas igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"No es que te vuelvas demente. Es que suplicarás la demencia".\\n—Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9780ae65-e3ef-49ce-ab5c-f6c81cc8111a\', \'multiverseId\': 586679}, \'multiverseid\': 586679}, {\'name\': \'Autel de la démence\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez une créature : Un joueur ciblé meule un nombre de cartes égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous ne deviendrez pas fou, mais vous supplierez de le devenir. »\\n—Wöhlrajh\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d4343a-cc0e-4755-af8f-be9a31c6efcd\', \'multiverseId\': 586742}, \'multiverseid\': 586742}, {\'name\': \'Altare della Demenza\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio macina carte pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Non voglio dire che impazzirai, ma piuttosto che pregherai di impazzire!"\\n—Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed590991-23e0-457f-b3a5-cc86a1d86c35\', \'multiverseId\': 586805}, \'multiverseid\': 586805}, {\'name\': \'狂気の祭壇\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、その生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前が狂気になるわけではない。狂気にしてくれと哀願するようになるのさ。」\\n――ヴォルラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a62843cf-c5dd-4b29-88b1-e30024f349ae\', \'multiverseId\': 586868}, \'multiverseid\': 586868}, {\'name\': \'Altar da Demência\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: O jogador alvo tritura uma quantidade de cards igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é que você vá enlouquecer. Você vai implorar pela loucura."\\n— Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba8473f-fe27-4c83-8376-03d9eed341d2\', \'multiverseId\': 586994}, \'multiverseid\': 586994}, {\'name\': \'痴呆祭坛\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：目标牌手磨若干牌，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这不是说你将要疯狂，而是你会盼望发狂。」\\n～瓦拉司\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be3e2cfb-9cb1-4a92-b8fb-ca9e035c3c94\', \'multiverseId\': 587120}, \'multiverseid\': 587120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar des Wahnsinns\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt so viele Karten, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Träume brachten weitere Visionen unseres Meisters: einen Altar, exquisit und perfekt. Wir müssen ihn sofort bauen."\\n—Schriften von Artonac, Priester von Gix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d94ccce-a841-4e7f-861a-81ce30e924f5\', \'multiverseId\': 587309}, \'multiverseid\': 587309}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la demencia\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: El jugador objetivo muele una cantidad de cartas igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"En mis sueños tuve otra visión de nuestro maestro: un altar, hermoso y perfecto. Debemos construirlo sin demora".\\n—Escritos de Artonac, sacerdote de Gix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06646751-19e4-445f-8ef1-c8fd025be940\', \'multiverseId\': 587372}, \'multiverseid\': 587372}, {\'name\': \'Autel de la démence\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez une créature : Un joueur ciblé meule un nombre de cartes égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Mes rêves m\'ont apporté d\'autres visions de notre maître : un autel, parfait et exquis. Nous devons le construire sans tarder. »\\n—Écrits d\'Artonac, prêtre de Gix", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982ba801-de0b-4753-87c5-f1ea8c826b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 587435}, \'multiverseid\': 587435}, {\'name\': \'Altare della Demenza\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio macina carte pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho ricevuto in sogno altre visioni del nostro maestro: un altare, magnifico e perfetto. Dobbiamo costruirlo immediatamente."\\n—Scritti di Artonac, sacerdote di Gix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ff1a94-1d14-4eb1-8c2c-f703339a48af\', \'multiverseId\': 587498}, \'multiverseid\': 587498}, {\'name\': \'狂気の祭壇\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、その生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「我が主から、夢を通して多くの幻視がもたらされた。卓越した美しさを持つ、非の打ちどころのない祭壇。ただちに制作に取りかかろう。」\\n――ギックスの僧侶、アルトナクの手記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb77ab1-5b8a-49cd-963e-637ed2ac3a53\', \'multiverseId\': 587561}, \'multiverseid\': 587561}, {\'name\': \'Altar da Demência\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: O jogador alvo tritura uma quantidade de cards igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Meus sonhos trouxeram mais visões de nosso mestre: um altar, refinado e perfeito. Precisamos construí-lo imediatamente."\\n— Escritos de Artonac, sacerdote de Gix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe1eccb9-9d98-4efb-91c6-c58d28f90fda\', \'multiverseId\': 587687}, \'multiverseid\': 587687}, {\'name\': \'痴呆祭坛\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：目标牌手磨若干牌，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「主人托梦让我看到了更多事物：一座祭坛，精致而完美。我们必须立刻造出来。」\\n～基克斯牧师亚托纳克的笔记\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e40c39-d5bb-44dd-801a-f898cf9e5fdf\', \'multiverseId\': 587750}, \'multiverseid\': 587750}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nDie Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine hat zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen den bestimmte Typ.\\nAndere Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586614&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df5b4af6-cd62-40a4-bd27-e7dc1b41b49e\', \'multiverseId\': 586614}, \'multiverseid\': 586614}, {\'name\': \'Autómata adaptativo\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Autómata adaptativo entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nEl Autómata adaptativo es del tipo elegido además de sus otros tipos.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dccc574d-b129-4d6f-9cbf-6ce75143372b\', \'multiverseId\': 586677}, \'multiverseid\': 586677}, {\'name\': \'Automate évolutif\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Automate évolutif arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nL\'Automate évolutif a le type choisi en plus de ses autres types.\\nLes autres créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09236538-8243-4e9e-b728-78328c5e2d48\', \'multiverseId\': 586740}, \'multiverseid\': 586740}, {\'name\': \'Automa Adattivo\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Automa Adattivo entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nL\'Automa Adattivo ha il tipo scelto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nLe altre creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e800492-f3da-488d-99d9-713296ba99ed\', \'multiverseId\': 586803}, \'multiverseid\': 586803}, {\'name\': \'順応する自動機械\', \'text\': \'順応する自動機械が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n順応する自動機械は、他のタイプに加えてその選ばれたタイプでもある。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプでありこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b29e4a-dda6-465c-a4e2-21d9263fc704\', \'multiverseId\': 586866}, \'multiverseid\': 586866}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Adaptável\', \'text\': \'Conforme Autômato Adaptável entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAutômato Adaptável é do tipo escolhido além de seus outros tipos.\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo escolhido que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc05032-f0c5-4e84-89c5-682016a5fe4a\', \'multiverseId\': 586992}, \'multiverseid\': 586992}, {\'name\': \'适境机械兽\', \'text\': \'于适境机械兽进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n适境机械兽额外具有该类别。\\n由你操控的其他该类别生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d2ec62-dc84-4252-b77d-47696a1567d6\', \'multiverseId\': 587118}, \'multiverseid\': 587118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nDie Anpassungsfähige Kampfmaschine hat zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen den bestimmte Typ.\\nAndere Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587307&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46135da3-7612-493d-9e2f-e8ae2b70a6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 587307}, \'multiverseid\': 587307}, {\'name\': \'Autómata adaptativo\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Autómata adaptativo entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nEl Autómata adaptativo es del tipo elegido además de sus otros tipos.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'773991be-b758-46c7-a86c-e570dfd45420\', \'multiverseId\': 587370}, \'multiverseid\': 587370}, {\'name\': \'Automate évolutif\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Automate évolutif arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nL\'Automate évolutif a le type choisi en plus de ses autres types.\\nLes autres créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83c46469-ec25-40c4-9574-9d9d0cd51fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 587433}, \'multiverseid\': 587433}, {\'name\': \'Automa Adattivo\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Automa Adattivo entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nL\'Automa Adattivo ha il tipo scelto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nLe altre creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2424438-9200-42f7-88c9-e0f0d797d3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 587496}, \'multiverseid\': 587496}, {\'name\': \'順応する自動機械\', \'text\': \'順応する自動機械が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n順応する自動機械は、他のタイプに加えてその選ばれたタイプでもある。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプでありこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef633092-a231-4d91-b236-f7087779f4c7\', \'multiverseId\': 587559}, \'multiverseid\': 587559}, {\'name\': \'Autômato Adaptável\', \'text\': \'Conforme Autômato Adaptável entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAutômato Adaptável é do tipo escolhido além de seus outros tipos.\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo escolhido que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc8c2464-8478-42b6-a059-d6e1b24a7242\', \'multiverseId\': 587685}, \'multiverseid\': 587685}, {\'name\': \'适境机械兽\', \'text\': \'于适境机械兽进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n适境机械兽额外具有该类别。\\n由你操控的其他该类别生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df127a1-c823-431b-958c-871cf7240901\', \'multiverseId\': 587748}, \'multiverseid\': 587748}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnods Altar\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Blutrinnen müssen tiefer sein. Für die Nervenstränge sind zusätzliche Haken erforderlich. Die Oberfläche könnte gröber sein."\\n—Ashnod, Konstruktionsnotizen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41407cd8-48b6-4304-ba94-ea394fbb286e\', \'multiverseId\': 587310}, \'multiverseid\': 587310}, {\'name\': \'Altar de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay que acanalar la sangre más profundamente. Hacen falta más ganchos para manipular los nervios. El punteo de superficies puede ser más impreciso".\\n—Ashnod, notas de diseño\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c93aa6-c220-4b46-aa28-3522f3337f9f\', \'multiverseId\': 587373}, \'multiverseid\': 587373}, {\'name\': "Autel d\'Ashnod", \'text\': \'Sacrifiez une créature : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Creuser plus profondément le canal pour l\'évacuation du sang. Il faut plus de crochets pour étirer les nerfs. La structure de surface pourrait être plus rugueuse. »\\n—Ashnod, notes de conception", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2c3a5a-1f56-4680-89bc-ea05e1f1d277\', \'multiverseId\': 587436}, \'multiverseid\': 587436}, {\'name\': \'Altare di Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I solchi per il sangue devono essere più profondi. Servono più ganci per la manipolazione dei nervi. La superficie dovrebbe essere più ruvida."\\n—Ashnod, note di costruzione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af51b7f-59a5-4d80-bdd5-ab6074f0c146\', \'multiverseId\': 587499}, \'multiverseid\': 587499}, {\'name\': \'アシュノッドの供犠台\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「血流溝はもっと深く。神経実装用に追加のフックが必要。表面の点刻はもっと目が粗くてもいい。」\\n――アシュノッドの設計メモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43b47932-ea91-4d47-bf12-b5d24cef358b\', \'multiverseId\': 587562}, \'multiverseid\': 587562}, {\'name\': \'Altar de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A canaleta sanguínea precisa ser mais profunda. Precisa de ganchos adicionais para manipular os nervos. O pontilhado da superfície poderia ser mais áspero."\\n— Ashnod, observações de projeto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e35df50-1351-49b5-aded-9bacf12866b5\', \'multiverseId\': 587688}, \'multiverseid\': 587688}, {\'name\': \'阿士诺的祭坛\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「血槽还要再深一些。需安装更多挂钩来牵引神经。表面纹路可以粗糙一点。」\\n～阿士诺，设计手札\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f4090f-bd1e-4e60-be0d-ffb411e4e65e\', \'multiverseId\': 587751}, \'multiverseid\': 587751}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ashnods Altar\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du Leichen zusammennähst, merkst du, wie die Gelenke zusammenpassen, wie die Nerven angeordnet sind und wie sich die Haut ablöst."\\n—Ashnod, zu Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586617&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc599ea5-d730-4333-ba70-7663c91d61b6\', \'multiverseId\': 586617}, \'multiverseid\': 586617}, {\'name\': \'Altar de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si tu trabajo consiste en serrar cadáveres, te fijas en las junturas de las articulaciones, la disposición de los nervios y en cómo se desprende la piel".\\n—Ashnod, a Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7445d16-0281-4433-81f0-5b4c0644f246\', \'multiverseId\': 586680}, \'multiverseid\': 586680}, {\'name\': "Autel d\'Ashnod", \'text\': \'Sacrifiez une créature : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« À force de découper des carcasses, tu finis par remarquer comment les articulations s\'emboîtent, comment les nerfs sont organisés et comment la peau s\'épluche. »\\n—Ashnod, à Tavnos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c071f7b4-2ab9-4506-9e5d-1292d86cae20\', \'multiverseId\': 586743}, \'multiverseid\': 586743}, {\'name\': \'Altare di Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Tagliando e aprendo cadaveri, si iniziano a notare gli incastri delle giunture, la disposizione dei nervi e il modo in cui la pelle si solleva."\\n—Ashnod a Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef22e6c-a7e3-456a-8af9-f9c05ed56b63\', \'multiverseId\': 586806}, \'multiverseid\': 586806}, {\'name\': \'アシュノッドの供犠台\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「亡骸を解体してみれば、関節の繋がり方も、神経の配置も、皮膚の剥ぎ取り方も理解できるでしょう。」\\n――アシュノッドからタウノスへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0608a4c8-1edb-4ef4-be1a-f2a49287630e\', \'multiverseId\': 586869}, \'multiverseid\': 586869}, {\'name\': \'Altar de Ashnod\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Se o seu trabalho é serrar carcaças, você sabe como as articulações se encaixam, como os nervos são distribuídos e como se esfola a pele."\\n— Ashnod, para Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce6e74b7-529d-4e83-91c9-d60c4588454d\', \'multiverseId\': 586995}, \'multiverseid\': 586995}, {\'name\': \'阿士诺的祭坛\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你要去锯解尸首，留意关节如何结合，神经如何排列，皮肤如何剥离。」\\n～阿士诺致达硌士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fbe9182-866d-4f71-8648-bc38c271b6cc\', \'multiverseId\': 587121}, \'multiverseid\': 587121}]', "[{'name': 'Astrales Füllhorn', 'text': 'Das Astrale Füllhorn kommt mit X Ladungsmarken ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Bestimme eine Farbe. Erzeuge für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Astralen Füllhorn ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586618&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd25965c-ecf7-4ffc-88a7-c3917cff9a9f', 'multiverseId': 586618}, 'multiverseid': 586618}, {'name': 'Cornucopia astral', 'text': 'La Cornucopia astral entra al campo de batalla con X contadores de carga sobre ella.\\n{T}: Elige un color. Agrega un maná de ese color por cada contador de carga sobre la Cornucopia astral.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586681&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b060876-5ee6-401c-88ba-de4cc65aafab', 'multiverseId': 586681}, 'multiverseid': 586681}, {'name': 'Cornucopée astrale', 'text': 'La Cornucopée astrale arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs « charge » sur elle.\\n{T} : Choisissez une couleur. Ajoutez un mana de cette couleur pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Cornucopée astrale.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586744&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65d302f3-8e78-42f4-9fb8-5502e78bdd7a', 'multiverseId': 586744}, 'multiverseid': 586744}, {'name': 'Cornucopia Astrale', 'text': 'La Cornucopia Astrale entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini carica.\\n{T}: Scegli un colore. Aggiungi un mana di quel colore per ogni segnalino carica sulla Cornucopia Astrale.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586807&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26a78d0f-bb09-4051-991d-b82cfba15193', 'multiverseId': 586807}, 'multiverseid': 586807}, {'name': '霊体のヤギ角', 'text': '霊体のヤギ角は、蓄積カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：色１色を選ぶ。霊体のヤギ角の上に置かれた蓄積カウンター１個につき１点のその色のマナを加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586870&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53e38d30-dd08-48b8-884d-4b57b4c8026b', 'multiverseId': 586870}, 'multiverseid': 586870}, {'name': 'Cornucópia Astral', 'text': 'Cornucópia Astral entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores de carga.\\n{T}: Escolha uma cor. Adicione um mana daquela cor para cada marcador de carga em Cornucópia Astral.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586996&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cea2a8af-3c44-4325-96ca-7cc97446020f', 'multiverseId': 586996}, 'multiverseid': 586996}, {'name': '星幽羊角', 'text': '星幽羊角进战场时上面有X个充电指示物。\\n{T}：选择一种颜色。星幽羊角上每有一个充电指示物，便加一点该色法术力。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587122&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1d09c0b-e7ef-4b48-8aef-e416a1c281d0', 'multiverseId': 587122}, 'multiverseid': 587122}]", "[{'name': 'Astrales Füllhorn', 'text': 'Das Astrale Füllhorn kommt mit X Ladungsmarken ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Bestimme eine Farbe. Erzeuge für jede Ladungsmarke auf dem Astralen Füllhorn ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587311&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4627b56-539e-4d97-9972-89e7a04f1304', 'multiverseId': 587311}, 'multiverseid': 587311}, {'name': 'Cornucopia astral', 'text': 'La Cornucopia astral entra al campo de batalla con X contadores de carga sobre ella.\\n{T}: Elige un color. Agrega un maná de ese color por cada contador de carga sobre la Cornucopia astral.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587374&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d7e14f5-9845-4a4c-9837-940b9d37b6c1', 'multiverseId': 587374}, 'multiverseid': 587374}, {'name': 'Cornucopée astrale', 'text': 'La Cornucopée astrale arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs « charge » sur elle.\\n{T} : Choisissez une couleur. Ajoutez un mana de cette couleur pour chaque marqueur « charge » sur la Cornucopée astrale.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587437&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d74f6c2-f3c8-4dec-aee1-83137add9b1d', 'multiverseId': 587437}, 'multiverseid': 587437}, {'name': 'Cornucopia Astrale', 'text': 'La Cornucopia Astrale entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini carica.\\n{T}: Scegli un colore. Aggiungi un mana di quel colore per ogni segnalino carica sulla Cornucopia Astrale.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587500&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52217ead-85c7-4eb4-8fa3-fcea13bb78df', 'multiverseId': 587500}, 'multiverseid': 587500}, {'name': '霊体のヤギ角', 'text': '霊体のヤギ角は、蓄積カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：色１色を選ぶ。霊体のヤギ角の上に置かれた蓄積カウンター１個につき１点のその色のマナを加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587563&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7acd3684-01b0-4d50-9647-a0d400807730', 'multiverseId': 587563}, 'multiverseid': 587563}, {'name': 'Cornucópia Astral', 'text': 'Cornucópia Astral entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores de carga.\\n{T}: Escolha uma cor. Adicione um mana daquela cor para cada marcador de carga em Cornucópia Astral.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587689&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55bfa3f7-ca71-49a1-b3a4-c85c8809819d', 'multiverseId': 587689}, 'multiverseid': 587689}, {'name': '星幽羊角', 'text': '星幽羊角进战场时上面有X个充电指示物。\\n{T}：选择一种颜色。星幽羊角上每有一个充电指示物，便加一点该色法术力。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587752&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e37dde16-233e-46c1-be74-cacef2a399c0', 'multiverseId': 587752}, 'multiverseid': 587752}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bernsteinmox\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe einer legendären Kreatur oder eines legendären Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein in Form gebrachter Ausschnitt der Zeit, welcher die Macht besitzt, epische Visionen zu verwirklichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef97477-ee5f-4c7c-9fb7-c419913ec19c\', \'multiverseId\': 586648}, \'multiverseid\': 586648}, {\'name\': \'Mox de ámbar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color de entre las criaturas y planeswalkers legendarios que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'Un momento tangible con el poder de hacer realidad visiones épicas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b4b5ef-fb09-47f2-b0d3-b969b40a36bd\', \'multiverseId\': 586711}, \'multiverseid\': 586711}, {\'name\': "Mox d\'ambre", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix parmi les couleurs des créatures légendaires et des planeswalkers légendaires que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Un instant rendu tangible, qui a le pouvoir de réaliser des visions épiques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808d4bdb-67fc-477a-905f-51618fda24e5\', \'multiverseId\': 586774}, \'multiverseid\': 586774}, {\'name\': "Mox d\'Ambra", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore tra quelli dei planeswalker e delle creature leggendarie che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Un frammento di tempo reso tangibile con il potere di trasformare in realtà visioni epiche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'993bc95f-eaa6-4f84-ab5a-0668ba3d14d3\', \'multiverseId\': 586837}, \'multiverseid\': 586837}, {\'name\': \'モックス・アンバー\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーの色の中の好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'瞬間が物質化したもので、壮大なビジョンを現実のものにする力がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8c9bfc-4367-4db5-aeb7-e0dc799ce92b\', \'multiverseId\': 586900}, \'multiverseid\': 586900}, {\'name\': \'Mox de Âmbar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor dentre as das criaturas e dos planeswalkers lendários que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Um momento no tempo feito tangível, ela tem o poder de concretizar visões épicas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f358774-0db8-46cf-852b-b69a80439f03\', \'multiverseId\': 587026}, \'multiverseid\': 587026}, {\'name\': \'琥珀玛珂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由你操控之传奇生物和鹏洛客所具有的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'历史时刻具化成物，它拥有能实现壮绝憧憬的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e903b6f8-05c9-4e3d-aae0-d6c05d435b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 587152}, \'multiverseid\': 587152}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bernsteinmox\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe einer legendären Kreatur oder eines legendären Planeswalkers, die bzw. den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein kristallisierter Moment aus der Zeit der Wiederherstellung, der erstmals während der Eiszeit entdeckt wurde. Ein temporales Rätsel, sogar für den größten Gelehrten."\\n—*Die Entdeckungen von Feldon*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1b6d5b-92f7-4da1-ae6c-9caba3de626c\', \'multiverseId\': 587341}, \'multiverseid\': 587341}, {\'name\': \'Mox de ámbar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color de entre las criaturas y planeswalkers legendarios que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Un momento de la Era de Reparación fijado en el tiempo, descubierto durante la Era Glacial. Es un enigma temporal incluso para el gran erudito".\\n—*Descubrimientos de Feldon*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'756cd6dd-6b77-4a88-a2bd-75b6b276eba9\', \'multiverseId\': 587404}, \'multiverseid\': 587404}, {\'name\': "Mox d\'ambre", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix parmi les couleurs des créatures légendaires et des planeswalkers légendaires que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "« Un instant cristallisé dans le temps de l\'Ère de la grande Restauration, découvert pendant l\'Ère glaciaire. Un mystère temporel, même pour le grand érudit. »\\n—*Les découvertes de Feldonn*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d87ff15-7c65-47ab-928d-d4de28da8d6f\', \'multiverseId\': 587467}, \'multiverseid\': 587467}, {\'name\': "Mox d\'Ambra", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore tra quelli dei planeswalker e delle creature leggendarie che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'"Un istante cristallizzato dell\\\'Era della Riparazione, scoperto per la prima volta durante l\\\'Era Glaciale. Un dilemma temporale, persino per il grande studioso in persona."\\n—*Le Scoperte di Feldon*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dc139c2-f390-42a0-b3b7-5b5b4f2c0465\', \'multiverseId\': 587530}, \'multiverseid\': 587530}, {\'name\': \'モックス・アンバー\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーの色の中の好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「大修復時代の一瞬を結晶化したこの代物は、氷河期の最中に初めて発見された。偉大な学者さえも手を焼く時空的難題である。」\\n――*「フェルドン発見記」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5562c38d-0a25-4f74-b6c0-f695855d1e64\', \'multiverseId\': 587593}, \'multiverseid\': 587593}, {\'name\': \'Mox de Âmbar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor dentre as das criaturas e dos planeswalkers lendários que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'"Um momento cristalizado da Era da Emenda, inicialmente descoberto durante a Era Glacial. Um dilema temporal, mesmo para o próprio grande erudito."\\n— *As Descobertas de Feldon*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09471c72-a6b6-45a5-9d81-eb429cc4753e\', \'multiverseId\': 587719}, \'multiverseid\': 587719}, {\'name\': \'琥珀玛珂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由你操控之传奇生物和鹏洛客所具有的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'「来自愈合年代的结晶时刻，却是在冰雪时代首先被人发现。这一时间难题，就连伟大学者自己也百思不得其解。」\\n～*《费顿发现录》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9407fae-fadc-4409-823f-7d231b671afa\', \'multiverseId\': 587782}, \'multiverseid\': 587782}]', "[{'name': 'Brunnen der verlorenen Träume', 'text': 'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {X} bezahlen, wobei X kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an dazuerhaltenen Lebenspunkten ist. Falls du dies tust, ziehe X Karten.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Manche behaupten, dass das durch das Ritual des Zurückweisens verloren gegangene Wissen durch das Wasser des Brunnens zurückkehrt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586675&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18de234a-70c9-4a51-9b5d-14cb3f0839b5', 'multiverseId': 586675}, 'multiverseid': 586675}, {'name': 'Pozo de los sueños perdidos', 'text': 'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {X}, donde X es menor o igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste. Si lo haces, roba X cartas.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Algunos dicen que el conocimiento perdido durante el ritual de expulsión regresa por las aguas del pozo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586738&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7cf66175-cd72-45f8-a67f-e8bcaae5332c', 'multiverseId': 586738}, 'multiverseid': 586738}, {'name': 'Puits des songes perdus', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {X}, X étant inférieur ou égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez X cartes.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'On dit que la connaissance perdue lors du Rituel de la Réprimande revient, distillée dans les eaux du puits.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586801&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60edf978-5ce2-420c-a979-caaa3ed59262', 'multiverseId': 586801}, 'multiverseid': 586801}, {'name': 'Pozzo dei Sogni Perduti', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {X}, dove X è pari o inferiore ai punti vita guadagnati. Se lo fai, pesca X carte.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Alcuni dicono che la conoscenza perduta durante il Rituale della Disapprovazione venga restituita tramite le acque del pozzo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586864&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '596f8299-e447-49d3-a132-f5daabcef902', 'multiverseId': 586864}, 'multiverseid': 586864}, {'name': '失われし夢の井戸', 'text': 'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。Ｘはあなたが得たライフの量以下の値である。そうしたなら、カードＸ枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '懲戒の儀式の中で失われた知識は、井戸の水から取り戻すことができると言われている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586927&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '382bf05a-990a-4bc0-bfcd-866dea2ba842', 'multiverseId': 586927}, 'multiverseid': 586927}, {'name': 'Poço dos Sonhos Perdidos', 'text': 'Toda vez que ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {X}, sendo X igual ou inferior à quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou. Se fizer isso, compre X cards.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Alguns dizem que o conhecimento perdido durante o Ritual de Repreensão é devolvido pelas águas do poço.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587053&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e09897d-672f-45f7-84be-77db8400388b', 'multiverseId': 587053}, 'multiverseid': 587053}, {'name': '迷梦深井', 'text': '每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{X}，X须等于或小于你所获得的生命数量。若你如此作，则抓X张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '传说在训诫仪式之中消失的知识，都会藉由井水涌回。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587179&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '535d185a-4285-4270-b227-be0f5dfd7c2c', 'multiverseId': 587179}, 'multiverseid': 587179}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brunnen der verlorenen Träume\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {X} bezahlen, wobei X kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an dazuerhaltenen Lebenspunkten ist. Falls du dies tust, ziehe X Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Wunsch kann kontrolliert werden. Träume sind viel chaotischer und werden nicht von der Vernunft gelenkt."\\n—*Hurkyls Metaphysik, Band II*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f07aa7b-f147-4027-ab60-a1cd57491135\', \'multiverseId\': 587368}, \'multiverseid\': 587368}, {\'name\': \'Pozo de los sueños perdidos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {X}, donde X es menor o igual a la cantidad de vidas que ganaste. Si lo haces, roba X cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los deseos se pueden controlar. Sin embargo, los sueños son mucho más caóticos y no se rigen por la razón".\\n—*Meditaciones metafísicas de Hurkyl, Vol. II*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9209d22-0113-467f-a4b3-051c8f2f09f6\', \'multiverseId\': 587431}, \'multiverseid\': 587431}, {\'name\': \'Puits des songes perdus\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {X}, X étant inférieur ou égal au nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez X cartes.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Un souhait peut être contrôlé. Les rêves sont plus chaotiques, et indépendants de tout raisonnement. »\\n—*Études métaphysiques d\'Hurkyl, vol. II*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'542aa00d-e75a-4b5a-86fb-8a0bc43042c6\', \'multiverseId\': 587494}, \'multiverseid\': 587494}, {\'name\': \'Pozzo dei Sogni Perduti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {X}, dove X è pari o inferiore ai punti vita guadagnati. Se lo fai, pesca X carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Un desiderio può essere controllato. I sogni sono molto più caotici e distanti dal raziocinio."\\n—*Metafisica di Hurkyl, vol. II*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723f6530-c434-4c60-a663-0c85f2407edb\', \'multiverseId\': 587557}, \'multiverseid\': 587557}, {\'name\': \'失われし夢の井戸\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。Ｘはそのあなたが得たライフの点数以下の値である。そうしたなら、カードＸ枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「願いは操ることができる。夢は遥かに混沌としていて、原理によって制御できない。」\\n――*「ハーキルの形而上学、第二巻」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0001b986-ca94-462e-9630-553ae5dfb6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 587620}, \'multiverseid\': 587620}, {\'name\': \'Poço dos Sonhos Perdidos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que ganha pontos de vida, você pode pagar {X}, sendo X igual ou inferior à quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou. Se fizer isso, compre X cards.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Um desejo pode ser controlado. Sonhos são muito mais caóticos, e o racional não os governa.\\n— *Metafísica de Hurkyl, vol. II*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aec6105-78d1-4d41-bc69-4f58b375a2d5\', \'multiverseId\': 587746}, \'multiverseid\': 587746}, {\'name\': \'迷梦深井\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{X}，X须等于或小于你所获得的生命数量。若你如此作，则抓X张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「愿望尚可操控。梦想则更要混沌许多，且不受理性约束。」\\n～*《河鼓形上学论》，卷II*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46d9968e-3a63-46c5-851c-f85e23589351\', \'multiverseId\': 587809}, \'multiverseid\': 587809}]', '[{\'name\': \'Calums Zauberbuch\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die meisten Bücher liefern einfach nur Wissen. Dieses hier erwartet welches zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8002c71-fce7-49e4-b3ed-d26499299ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 586637}, \'multiverseid\': 586637}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría de libros solo aportan conocimientos. Este espera algunos de ellos a cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96265fa8-7230-481d-b7a8-dfeb602b105e\', \'multiverseId\': 586700}, \'multiverseid\': 586700}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jalum\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'La plupart des livres vous apportent la connaissance. Celui-ci attend que vous rendiez la pareille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586763&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e9b4b6-8737-4d49-bf4c-ed451e143a53\', \'multiverseId\': 586763}, \'multiverseid\': 586763}, {\'name\': \'Tomo di Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La maggior parte dei libri offre conoscenze. Questo si aspetta anche qualcosa in cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e8309c-bfe1-40a0-a8c1-ba349a515c87\', \'multiverseId\': 586826}, \'multiverseid\': 586826}, {\'name\': \'ジェイラム秘本\', \'text\': \'{2},{T}：カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'大抵の書物は単に知識を伝えてくれるもんだ。この本ときたらお返しを期待するんだよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c48d9ded-2f07-495c-90b1-338eeddee0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 586889}, \'multiverseid\': 586889}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'A maioria dos livros simplesmente oferece conhecimento. Esse aqui espera algo em troca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c87e12-fddf-475d-a605-996a6f87c21f\', \'multiverseId\': 587015}, \'multiverseid\': 587015}, {\'name\': \'贾伦的巨著\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'大部分的书只是传达知识，但这一本还期待些回馈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36caccd-3b3d-448a-b792-d74ab47950c3\', \'multiverseId\': 587141}, \'multiverseid\': 587141}]', '[{\'name\': \'Calums Zauberbuch\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Glyphen beschreiben ein Gerät der Thran, das eine Maschinenarmee steuern kann, aber die Abmessungen ergeben keinen Sinn. Es wäre fast so groß wie der Nullmond."\\n—Aus Urzas Tagebuch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587330&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edecf0bf-bae3-45ff-a01a-387a90034374\', \'multiverseId\': 587330}, \'multiverseid\': 587330}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Estos glifos describen un dispositivo thran capaz de controlar un ejército de máquinas, pero las medidas son un sinsentido. Es casi del tamaño de la Luna de Nulificación".\\n—Diario de Urza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23682cb8-02cf-43b6-93bc-20792bdcaa40\', \'multiverseId\': 587393}, \'multiverseid\': 587393}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jalum\', \'text\': "{2}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Ces glyphes décrivent un appareil thran capable de contrôler une armée de machines, mais ses dimensions n\'ont pas de sens. Il a quasiment la taille de la Lune stérile. »\\n—Urza, journal", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4833303d-c705-46c8-a861-e0928d872fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 587456}, \'multiverseid\': 587456}, {\'name\': \'Tomo di Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Questi glifi descrivono un dispositivo Thran capace di controllare un esercito meccanico, ma le dimensioni non tornano. È grande quasi quanto la Luna Nulla."\\n—Urza, diario\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d20a2222-45e1-4e63-aa24-f2336e91c7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 587519}, \'multiverseid\': 587519}, {\'name\': \'ジェイラム秘本\', \'text\': \'{2},{T}：カード１枚を引き、その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「この象形文字の羅列はスランの機械軍団の操縦装置について記述しているようだが、その寸法は信じがたい。虚月ほどの大きさになる。」\\n――ウルザの日記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8dfb9b6-dd73-4222-a9f0-41c7cfa11ad0\', \'multiverseId\': 587582}, \'multiverseid\': 587582}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Jalum\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Esses glifos descrevem um dispositivo thran capaz de controlar um exército de máquinas, mas as dimensões não fazem sentido. Ele tem quase o tamanho da Lua Nula."\\n— Urza, diário\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7f8a144-490b-4cdb-b1e2-96a05c3c4977\', \'multiverseId\': 587708}, \'multiverseid\': 587708}, {\'name\': \'贾伦的巨著\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这些图符讲述的是能够操控整支机械军队的索蓝装置，但上面写的尺寸并不合理。它就跟虚无之月一般大。」\\n～克撒，随身日记\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c658a01-038a-42d2-8313-965916a1101f\', \'multiverseId\': 587771}, \'multiverseid\': 587771}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Nach Gildentradition kann jeder Fleck mehrfarbigen Lichts auf Kopfsteinpflaster als neutraler Boden dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc6228b-c048-4c7e-97ee-36a8eb2a1b81\', \'multiverseId\': 586623}, \'multiverseid\': 586623}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Por tradición gremial, cualquier cerco de luz multicolor que haya sobre los adoquines puede usarse como terreno neutral.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e29e3d-ed1a-4f52-a665-6aac57ed11ee\', \'multiverseId\': 586686}, \'multiverseid\': 586686}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Selon la tradition de la guilde, toute flaque de lumière multicolore sur les pavés peut faire office de terrain neutre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6b4d9d-c4a4-4675-af85-b3bd5810eeef\', \'multiverseId\': 586749}, \'multiverseid\': 586749}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La tradizione delle gilde vuole che qualsiasi macchia di luce multicolore sul selciato possa fungere da territorio neutrale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03a4063-f053-4918-abfd-2460ae0fb9ee\', \'multiverseId\': 586812}, \'multiverseid\': 586812}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギルドの伝統により、多色の光が落ちる石畳は中立地域とされる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df63e875-cde2-4729-af2b-13ac7b698fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 586875}, \'multiverseid\': 586875}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Pela tradição da guilda, qualquer facho de luz multicolorida no paralelepípedo pode servir como território neutro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1fff41-1bf7-4d16-a67f-28989a41cfbf\', \'multiverseId\': 587001}, \'multiverseid\': 587001}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'按照公会传统，凡是多彩混色灯光照亮的鹅卵石地面，都可当作中立地带。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5b2e67c-bbe3-4dab-98a0-32ff224fd5dc\', \'multiverseId\': 587127}, \'multiverseid\': 587127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Feldons jüngste Entdeckung scheint sich auf dieselben ‚Erinnerungen des Landes\\\' zu stützen, die meine Frau untersucht hat. Ich wünschte, sie könnte es sehen."\\n—Schriften von Drafna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587316&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2426756-798d-464d-bf1e-fea8531966b8\', \'multiverseId\': 587316}, \'multiverseid\': 587316}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Parece que el último hallazgo de Feldon se alimenta de los \\\'recuerdos de la tierra\\\' que estudiaba mi mujer. Ojalá estuviera aquí para verlo".\\n—Escritos de Drafna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5feb2a3d-9475-4227-90e9-be9de6b13540\', \'multiverseId\': 587379}, \'multiverseid\': 587379}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La dernière découverte de Feldonn semble être inspirée des mêmes \'souvenirs de la terre\' que mon épouse avait étudiés. Si seulement elle pouvait voir ça. »\\n—Écrits de Drafna", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587442&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b72850-9f30-43f5-b9c2-4036e7a34c09\', \'multiverseId\': 587442}, \'multiverseid\': 587442}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromatica\', \'text\': \'Le terre che controlli hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ultima scoperta di Feldon sembra fare riferimento agli stessi \\\'ricordi della terra\\\' studiati da mia moglie. Vorrei che lei potesse vederla."\\n—Scritti di Drafna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'321ae10c-a3a5-4d63-9b5b-188dbb71237f\', \'multiverseId\': 587505}, \'multiverseid\': 587505}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「フェルドンによる最新の発見は、妻が研究していた『かの地の記憶』を下敷きとしているようだ。妻にも見せてやりたかった。」\\n――ドラフナの手記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b196ffc-2adf-43d3-91e6-59c7f7535f64\', \'multiverseId\': 587568}, \'multiverseid\': 587568}, {\'name\': \'Lanterna Cromática\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos que você controla têm: "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A última descoberta de Feldon parece vir das mesmas \\\'lembranças da terra\\\' que minha esposa estudava. Como eu gostaria que ela pudesse ver isso..."\\n— Escritos de Drafna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f9853e-b962-453b-91da-958e6f241958\', \'multiverseId\': 587694}, \'multiverseid\': 587694}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「费顿最新的发现成就，似乎是循妻子先前的『大地回忆』研究结果而得。真希望她也能看到。」\\n～札夫拿的笔记\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb773f3-5eec-4764-902a-5c4decc6ed77\', \'multiverseId\': 587757}, \'multiverseid\': 587757}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatischer Stern\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere den Chromatischen Stern: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nWenn der Chromatische Stern aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586624&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d71246-9e5b-4a73-a566-a4f4c57024ae\', \'multiverseId\': 586624}, \'multiverseid\': 586624}, {\'name\': \'Estrella cromática\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Estrella cromática: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\nCuando la Estrella cromática vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d9f01c6-7b5c-490e-b92a-925c32ef2e9b\', \'multiverseId\': 586687}, \'multiverseid\': 586687}, {\'name\': \'Étoile chromatique\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Étoile chromatique : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\nQuand l\'Étoile chromatique est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557cd253-652d-4373-bae0-2ab03fda998a\', \'multiverseId\': 586750}, \'multiverseid\': 586750}, {\'name\': \'Stella Cromatica\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Stella Cromatica: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\nQuando la Stella Cromatica viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89f1ba5-c27b-4924-b53a-4c9e06fe26a1\', \'multiverseId\': 586813}, \'multiverseid\': 586813}, {\'name\': \'彩色の星\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, 彩色の星を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n彩色の星が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056fd465-7e11-4de9-9151-99567c82b2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 586876}, \'multiverseid\': 586876}, {\'name\': \'Estrela Cromática\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrifique Estrela Cromática: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\nQuando Estrela Cromática for colocada num cemitério vinda do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f90103-8e6e-4b91-a2b7-9379b7726fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 587002}, \'multiverseid\': 587002}, {\'name\': \'五彩星\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，牺牲五彩星：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n当五彩星从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093848fe-601a-4f76-a716-f9e36ff0e5c0\', \'multiverseId\': 587128}, \'multiverseid\': 587128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatischer Stern\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere den Chromatischen Stern: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nWenn der Chromatische Stern aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b52542-384e-45f0-a5dd-8830ad5e5662\', \'multiverseId\': 587317}, \'multiverseid\': 587317}, {\'name\': \'Estrella cromática\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Estrella cromática: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\nCuando la Estrella cromática vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac57355-a4d1-41d6-9f73-9bec1eb7a091\', \'multiverseId\': 587380}, \'multiverseid\': 587380}, {\'name\': \'Étoile chromatique\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Étoile chromatique : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\nQuand l\'Étoile chromatique est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e29291-97b3-49be-ba9e-298517f4bf1a\', \'multiverseId\': 587443}, \'multiverseid\': 587443}, {\'name\': \'Stella Cromatica\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Stella Cromatica: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\nQuando la Stella Cromatica viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a98336-b170-4888-bc69-1f2fff43caa0\', \'multiverseId\': 587506}, \'multiverseid\': 587506}, {\'name\': \'彩色の星\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, 彩色の星を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n彩色の星が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e163f4-f70d-4e13-8693-c6ca5733b62c\', \'multiverseId\': 587569}, \'multiverseid\': 587569}, {\'name\': \'Estrela Cromática\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrifique Estrela Cromática: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\nQuando Estrela Cromática for colocada num cemitério vinda do campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76355750-cc15-42fb-b86a-687b733ce7d4\', \'multiverseId\': 587695}, \'multiverseid\': 587695}, {\'name\': \'五彩星\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，牺牲五彩星：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n当五彩星从战场进入坟墓场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e388d13-1f8a-40e4-b7e8-53ec1e59f08b\', \'multiverseId\': 587758}, \'multiverseid\': 587758}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorn aus Amethyst\', \'text\': \'Nichtkreatur-Zaubersprüche kosten beim Wirken {1} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Man kann ihn in den Minen der Dunklen Mäander finden; er scheint dann am hellsten, wenn niemand ihn anschaut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586673&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c0c84a4-bf6b-48f4-aea0-2be5ad93446a\', \'multiverseId\': 586673}, \'multiverseid\': 586673}, {\'name\': \'Espina de amatista\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {1} más lanzar hechizos que no sean de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Extraída de una cueva en los Meandros Oscuros, brilla más que nunca cuando nadie está mirando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'614f4e7f-4d2c-4258-8eed-99e4326c13bd\', \'multiverseId\': 586736}, \'multiverseid\': 586736}, {\'name\': "Éclat d\'améthyste", \'text\': \'Les sorts non-créature coûtent {1} de plus à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Minée dans une caverne des Méandres obscurs, elle brille le plus quand personne ne la regarde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'407e43e5-6583-44c6-a230-8c4b46761d56\', \'multiverseId\': 586799}, \'multiverseid\': 586799}, {\'name\': \'Spina di Ametista\', \'text\': \'Le magie non creatura costano {1} in più per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Estratta da una caverna nei Meandri Oscuri, riluce in tutto il suo splendore quando nessuno guarda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934e11c7-2b4b-42b2-a172-91e94b4bbf85\', \'multiverseId\': 586862}, \'multiverseid\': 586862}, {\'name\': \'アメジストのとげ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'闇うねりの洞窟から発掘されたそれは、誰も見ていない時に最も光り輝く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8c2046-1d71-497c-96a0-5863f94f4015\', \'multiverseId\': 586925}, \'multiverseid\': 586925}, {\'name\': \'Espinho de Ametista\', \'text\': \'As mágicas não de criatura custam {1} a mais para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Extraído de uma caverna nos Meandros Escuros, ele brilha mais quando ninguém está olhando.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7872731-8720-467a-ae5b-e6398b758a0a\', \'multiverseId\': 587051}, \'multiverseid\': 587051}, {\'name\': \'紫水晶刺\', \'text\': \'非生物咒语增加{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它是从暗曲礁的洞窟中挖出来的，只在没人看时放出明亮光芒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76675720-ff79-455e-9e3b-319e82047bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 587177}, \'multiverseid\': 587177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorn aus Amethyst\', \'text\': \'Nichtkreatur-Zaubersprüche kosten beim Wirken {1} mehr.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Geode muss im Mondlicht abgebaut und mit einem silbernen Hammer aufgeschlagen werden."\\n—*Buch der Hindernisse*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4662c17a-f2e6-42d3-a88e-d93927ffc61d\', \'multiverseId\': 587366}, \'multiverseid\': 587366}, {\'name\': \'Espina de amatista\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {1} más lanzar hechizos que no sean de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La geoda se debe extraer a la luz de la luna y abrirse con un martillo de plata".\\n—*Tomo de las obstrucciones*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb2cb93-ed67-4e2d-a710-e547f7e75234\', \'multiverseId\': 587429}, \'multiverseid\': 587429}, {\'name\': "Éclat d\'améthyste", \'text\': \'Les sorts non-créature coûtent {1} de plus à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La géode doit être extraite au clair de lune et fendue par un marteau d\'argent. »\\n—*Tome des obstructions*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29d31079-7025-489d-9d81-b39a22b9a911\', \'multiverseId\': 587492}, \'multiverseid\': 587492}, {\'name\': \'Spina di Ametista\', \'text\': \'Le magie non creatura costano {1} in più per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il geode deve essere estratto alla luce della luna e infranto con un martello d\\\'argento."\\n—*Tomo delle Ostruzioni*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c28011-7c91-42c9-9a6e-12064a7f5581\', \'multiverseId\': 587555}, \'multiverseid\': 587555}, {\'name\': \'アメジストのとげ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}多くなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「晶洞石は月光の下採掘し、銀の槌で砕き割るべし。」\\n――*「障害の秘本」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad9269a9-8866-4cf6-827d-77f5533d3741\', \'multiverseId\': 587618}, \'multiverseid\': 587618}, {\'name\': \'Espinho de Ametista\', \'text\': \'As mágicas não de criatura custam {1} a mais para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O geodo precisa ser minerado ao luar e aberto por um martelo de prata."\\n— *Tomo das Obstruções*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9830aa6b-9dc9-4925-9ae0-5f58013627f7\', \'multiverseId\': 587744}, \'multiverseid\': 587744}, {\'name\': \'紫水晶刺\', \'text\': \'非生物咒语增加{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「晶岩须在月光下开采，用银锤方能凿开。」\\n～*《障法巨著》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa39d62-39aa-4a93-9e3a-0730448fd2dc\', \'multiverseId\': 587807}, \'multiverseid\': 587807}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingesperrte Sonne\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Eingesperrte Sonne ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nKreaturen der bestimmten Farbe, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn eine Fähigkeit eines Landes bewirkt, dass du ein oder mehr Mana der bestimmten Farbe erzeugst, erzeuge ein zusätzliches Mana jener Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57649f07-f5ab-4144-80ea-40256381b4df\', \'multiverseId\': 586622}, \'multiverseid\': 586622}, {\'name\': \'Sol enjaulado\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Sol enjaulado entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del color elegido obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que una habilidad de una tierra te haga agregar uno o más manás del color elegido, agrega un maná adicional de ese color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1bb592a-0a56-47ab-8464-e3bc7d73a867\', \'multiverseId\': 586685}, \'multiverseid\': 586685}, {\'name\': \'Soleil emprisonné\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Soleil emprisonné arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez de la couleur choisie gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une capacité de terrain vous fait ajouter au moins un mana de la couleur choisie, ajoutez un mana supplémentaire de cette couleur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a146740-a81e-4e1b-b9b6-8546ea35c2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 586748}, \'multiverseid\': 586748}, {\'name\': \'Sole Ingabbiato\', \'text\': "Mentre il Sole Ingabbiato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nLe creature che controlli del colore scelto prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'abilità di una terra ti fa aggiungere uno o più mana del colore scelto, aggiungi un mana addizionale di quel colore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c59dbeb-68bf-4358-8317-45474289cbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 586811}, \'multiverseid\': 586811}, {\'name\': \'かごの中の太陽\', \'text\': \'かごの中の太陽が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれた色であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n土地の能力によりあなたがその選ばれた色の１点以上のマナを加えるたび、追加でその色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d14703-3d21-4705-8fbe-d4cb9cae690e\', \'multiverseId\': 586874}, \'multiverseid\': 586874}, {\'name\': \'Sol Engaiolado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Sol Engaiolado entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nAs criaturas que você controla da cor escolhida recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que uma habilidade de um terreno fizer com que você adicione um ou mais manas da cor escolhida, adicione um mana adicional daquela cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e636337-11e1-4710-a9ed-a739c3cad97d\', \'multiverseId\': 587000}, \'multiverseid\': 587000}, {\'name\': \'遭囚太阳\', \'text\': \'于遭囚太阳进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n由你操控的该色生物得+1/+1。\\n每当一个地的异能让你加一点或数点所选颜色的法术力时，额外加一点该色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0e5d7d2-627e-4494-98c3-3a2ef07380d5\', \'multiverseId\': 587126}, \'multiverseid\': 587126}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingesperrte Sonne\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Eingesperrte Sonne ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nKreaturen der bestimmten Farbe, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn eine Fähigkeit eines Landes bewirkt, dass du ein oder mehr Mana der bestimmten Farbe erzeugst, erzeuge ein zusätzliches Mana jener Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587315&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3d576d-a9e5-4563-8428-3dfbd131232e\', \'multiverseId\': 587315}, \'multiverseid\': 587315}, {\'name\': \'Sol enjaulado\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Sol enjaulado entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del color elegido obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que una habilidad de una tierra te haga agregar uno o más manás del color elegido, agrega un maná adicional de ese color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690cac0c-dd41-4696-b021-dd7bd41c7d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 587378}, \'multiverseid\': 587378}, {\'name\': \'Soleil emprisonné\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Soleil emprisonné arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez de la couleur choisie gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une capacité de terrain vous fait ajouter au moins un mana de la couleur choisie, ajoutez un mana supplémentaire de cette couleur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e34860d-d009-43f6-89a5-a90aa7bc8cd0\', \'multiverseId\': 587441}, \'multiverseid\': 587441}, {\'name\': \'Sole Ingabbiato\', \'text\': "Mentre il Sole Ingabbiato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nLe creature che controlli del colore scelto prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'abilità di una terra ti fa aggiungere uno o più mana del colore scelto, aggiungi un mana addizionale di quel colore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53160691-e587-4b28-89ca-648ea6eb4d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 587504}, \'multiverseid\': 587504}, {\'name\': \'かごの中の太陽\', \'text\': \'かごの中の太陽が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれた色であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n土地の能力によりあなたがその選ばれた色の１点以上のマナを加えるたび、追加でその色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02aa4ef4-2e31-4bd5-ba16-1bad5c168820\', \'multiverseId\': 587567}, \'multiverseid\': 587567}, {\'name\': \'Sol Engaiolado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Sol Engaiolado entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nAs criaturas que você controla da cor escolhida recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que uma habilidade de um terreno fizer com que você adicione um ou mais manas da cor escolhida, adicione um mana adicional daquela cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3be2391d-b673-496b-bead-5c00502431e6\', \'multiverseId\': 587693}, \'multiverseid\': 587693}, {\'name\': \'遭囚太阳\', \'text\': \'于遭囚太阳进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n由你操控的该色生物得+1/+1。\\n每当一个地的异能让你加一点或数点所选颜色的法术力时，额外加一点该色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d488237-fb9c-4d6d-a897-a1a9242795d6\', \'multiverseId\': 587756}, \'multiverseid\': 587756}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfenbeinturm\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand minus 4 ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Bewohner des Elfenbeinturms schätzen Gelehrsamkeit über alles und belohnen die, die ihr Leben nicht dem Machtstreben, sondern dem Wissen opfern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586636&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49b9226b-1aab-4826-a960-1de98d0b17d2\', \'multiverseId\': 586636}, \'multiverseid\': 586636}, {\'name\': \'Torre de marfil\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, ganas X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano menos 4.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los moradores de la torre de marfil, que valoran la erudición sobre todas las cosas, premian a aquellos que sacrifican el poder a cambio del conocimiento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6182122-1f28-47a8-9f80-164e24692e35\', \'multiverseId\': 586699}, \'multiverseid\': 586699}, {\'name\': "Tour d\'ivoire", \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main moins 4.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Appréciant l\'érudition par-dessus tout, les habitants de la Tour d\'ivoire récompensent ceux qui sacrifient la puissance pour la connaissance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'459ee7d5-d98b-4a73-86ee-2d8541010df9\', \'multiverseId\': 586762}, \'multiverseid\': 586762}, {\'name\': "Torre d\'Avorio", \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guadagni X punti vita, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano meno 4.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "I residenti della Torre d\'Avorio tengono in grande considerazione l\'erudizione e ricompensano chi sacrifica il potere per la conoscenza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a167ff9-1571-4a45-bd3c-ecd9d47b8ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 586825}, \'multiverseid\': 586825}, {\'name\': \'象牙の塔\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数から４を引いた値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'象牙の塔の住人たちは、何にも増して学識を重んじ、知識のために力を犠牲にする者に褒美を与える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa08b450-49f9-460f-9c2c-974e75cd14ad\', \'multiverseId\': 586888}, \'multiverseid\': 586888}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Marfim\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você ganha X de pontos de vida, sendo X o número de cards na sua mão menos 4.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Valorizando a erudição acima de tudo, os habitantes da Torre de Marfim recompensam aqueles que sacrificam o poder em nome do conhecimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78318626-42df-450b-afbe-6f98dfe04152\', \'multiverseId\': 587014}, \'multiverseid\': 587014}, {\'name\': \'象牙塔\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你获得X点生命，X为你手牌的数量减4。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'象牙塔中居民奉求知为毕生追索，在此处牺牲力量换取知识必有回报。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e824c797-0a23-4d80-a8f4-604c82ddaa15\', \'multiverseId\': 587140}, \'multiverseid\': 587140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfenbeinturm\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand minus 4 ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Umringt von weißem Stein war Terisia eine Stadt der Gelehrsamkeit und des Wissens, in der die Magie einer von der Künstlichkeit verschlungenen Welt eine bessere Zukunft versprach."\\n—*Der Artefakt-Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587329&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b690ee3b-a6cc-48bb-806e-d79ef7437eec\', \'multiverseId\': 587329}, \'multiverseid\': 587329}, {\'name\': \'Torre de marfil\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, ganas X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano menos 4.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Adornada con piedra blanca, Terisia era una ciudad de academia y conocimiento donde la magia prometía un futuro mejor para un mundo devorado por los artificios".\\n—*La Guerra de las Antigüedades</>\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28bb2ad2-eadc-4d88-b1a3-609ca5e92220\', \'multiverseId\': 587392}, \'multiverseid\': 587392}, {\'name\': "Tour d\'ivoire", \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main moins 4.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Cerclée de pierre blanche, Terisia était une cité d\'érudits et de savoir, où la magie promettait un avenir brillant à un monde dévoré par l\'artifice. »\\n—*La Guerre des Antiquités</>", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aca9b38-9a7c-486b-82ff-716dfd69ab21\', \'multiverseId\': 587455}, \'multiverseid\': 587455}, {\'name\': "Torre d\'Avorio", \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guadagni X punti vita, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano meno 4.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cinta di pietra bianca, Terisia era una città di erudizione e conoscenza, dove la magia prometteva un futuro radioso in un mondo divorato dall\\\'artificio."\\n—*La Guerra delle Antichità</>\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b339e0b0-0a15-446b-8e05-3b75dc837db5\', \'multiverseId\': 587518}, \'multiverseid\': 587518}, {\'name\': \'象牙の塔\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数から４を引いた値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'白岩に取り囲まれたテリシアは学問と知識の都市であり、工学によって貪りつくされた世界において、魔法による輝かしい未来が約束された場所である。\\n――*「アンティキティー戦争」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2e015e-5ffa-4efc-9bee-fff790c7e362\', \'multiverseId\': 587581}, \'multiverseid\': 587581}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Marfim\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você ganha X de pontos de vida, sendo X o número de cards na sua mão menos 4.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Circundada pela pedra branca, Terisia era uma cidade de erudição e conhecimento, onde a magia prometia um futuro melhor a um mundo devorado pelo artifício."\\n— *A Guerra das Antiguidades </>\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b571ad-6955-4627-8c12-c9685ed6ffde\', \'multiverseId\': 587707}, \'multiverseid\': 587707}, {\'name\': \'象牙塔\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你获得X点生命，X为你手牌的数量减4。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「泰瑞西亚周遭白石环绕，乃是求学与知识之城，此处的魔法允诺为遭奇械吞噬的世界带来光明未来。」\\n～*《古文明之战》</>\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f033c970-14b5-4b1c-9803-9577464f9188\', \'multiverseId\': 587770}, \'multiverseid\': 587770}]', '[{\'name\': \'Faszinierende Sphäre\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine bleibende Karte enttappt wird, millt der Beherrscher der bleibenden Karte eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Schritt in Richtung auf ein Ziel bedeutet, sich zwei Schritte weiter von einem anderen zu entfernen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5d495ab-d355-41e8-a04a-6dfc929d3386\', \'multiverseId\': 586644}, \'multiverseid\': 586644}, {\'name\': \'Orbe hipnótica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un permanente se enderece, el controlador de ese permanente muele una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Dar un paso en una dirección equivale a alejarse dos pasos de otra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6faf485-3bc8-41a3-9ea0-711c0dccf9a4\', \'multiverseId\': 586707}, \'multiverseid\': 586707}, {\'name\': \'Orbe mesmérique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un permanent devient dégagé, le contrôleur de ce permanent meule une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "On approche plus vite de la fin qu\'on ne s\'éloigne du début.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e4fb353-e3e2-47a0-bebb-f3fed06454df\', \'multiverseId\': 586770}, \'multiverseid\': 586770}, {\'name\': \'Globo Mesmerico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un permanente viene STAPpato, il controllore di quel permanente macina una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Un passo verso una direzione significa due passi più lontano da un\'altra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69eb19ff-a5f8-4031-80dc-ceaf04e35f66\', \'multiverseId\': 586833}, \'multiverseid\': 586833}, {\'name\': \'催眠の宝珠\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つがアンタップ状態になるたび、そのパーマネントのコントローラーはカード１枚を切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ある方向へ一歩進めば、違う場所からは二歩離れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238d8f5b-f581-4c71-b01b-ec713d6d57f5\', \'multiverseId\': 586896}, \'multiverseid\': 586896}, {\'name\': \'Orbe Mesmérica\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma permanente é desvirada, o controlador daquela permanente tritura um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Dar um passo em uma direção é dar dois passos para longe de outra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a945eb70-566a-4672-9c66-360f4a2a0b53\', \'multiverseId\': 587022}, \'multiverseid\': 587022}, {\'name\': \'催眠珠\', \'text\': \'每当一个永久物成为未横置时，该永久物的操控者磨一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'往正确的方向踏一步，便会比往其他方向多出两步之远。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c10398-f90e-4948-8705-2f8ccf7720c2\', \'multiverseId\': 587148}, \'multiverseid\': 587148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Faszinierende Sphäre\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine bleibende Karte enttappt wird, millt der Beherrscher der bleibenden Karte eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich glaube jetzt, dass die seltsame Kugel eine Art Sicherheitsvorrichtung der Thran war. Diese Theorie wird dadurch untermauert, dass ich mich nicht mehr daran erinnern kann, wo ich sie gefunden habe."\\n—Aus dem Tagebuch von Tocasia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587337&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2667f43-d6c8-475e-8b1f-51a18a3a5de5\', \'multiverseId\': 587337}, \'multiverseid\': 587337}, {\'name\': \'Orbe hipnótica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un permanente se enderece, el controlador de ese permanente muele una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora creo que el extraño orbe era una clase de dispositivo de seguridad thran. No logro recordar dónde lo encontré, lo que refuerza esta teoría".\\n—Del diario de Tocasia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f3a2e6-2f52-48f7-a8a3-0489e1c97995\', \'multiverseId\': 587400}, \'multiverseid\': 587400}, {\'name\': \'Orbe mesmérique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un permanent devient dégagé, le contrôleur de ce permanent meule une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Je pense désormais que l\'orbe étrange était une sorte de dispositif de sécurité thran. Ce qui corrobore cette théorie, c\'est que je ne me rappelle plus où je l\'ai trouvé. »\\n—Tocasia, extrait de journal", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d45d02ff-3ff6-480a-bca3-ad3908af7870\', \'multiverseId\': 587463}, \'multiverseid\': 587463}, {\'name\': \'Globo Mesmerico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un permanente viene STAPpato, il controllore di quel permanente macina una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ritengo che lo strano globo fosse una sorta di dispositivo di sicurezza dei Thran. A supporto di questa teoria, non ricordo più dove l\\\'ho trovato."\\n—Tocasia, annotazione del diario\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'803a3559-21c6-48f3-b7f5-2cd96f29046f\', \'multiverseId\': 587526}, \'multiverseid\': 587526}, {\'name\': \'催眠の宝珠\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つがアンタップ状態になるたび、そのパーマネントのコントローラーはカード１枚を切削する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「私は今になって、あの奇妙なオーブがスランの警備装置の一種だと確信している。この説を裏付けるように、もう発見場所を思い出せなくなっている。」\\n――トカシアの日記\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9738f93-73ee-4780-889e-20710aa4b29d\', \'multiverseId\': 587589}, \'multiverseid\': 587589}, {\'name\': \'Orbe Mesmérica\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma permanente é desvirada, o controlador daquela permanente tritura um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"No momento, creio que o orbe estranho fosse um tipo de dispositivo de segurança thran. Ponto a favor dessa teoria: não consigo mais lembrar onde o encontrei."\\n— Tocasia, em trecho de diário\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63b70cbc-c8ea-4732-af2d-fd6234de2fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 587715}, \'multiverseid\': 587715}, {\'name\': \'催眠珠\', \'text\': \'每当一个永久物成为未横置时，该永久物的操控者磨一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我现在相信这颗奇异法珠是某种索蓝安全装置。能佐证这想法的依据是，我已经想不起来是在哪找到它的了。」\\n～托卡西雅，日志一笔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61447b29-dee0-4d91-ace7-f0795c4e45e9\', \'multiverseId\': 587778}, \'multiverseid\': 587778}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet ist."\\n—Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586671&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7f6155-696f-4bf7-aa02-421432850ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 586671}, \'multiverseid\': 586671}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado".\\n—Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369d2907-93f5-4b6d-ba5a-b6e373fc2fda\', \'multiverseId\': 586734}, \'multiverseid\': 586734}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. »\\n—Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577baed8-2953-4cbf-9189-93522ef99440\', \'multiverseId\': 586797}, \'multiverseid\': 586797}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciarsi a testa bassa nella battaglia è segno di grande saggezza... quando si è preparati."\\n—Kenjek, capitano delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac125ec7-7b5e-4d55-b4fd-bc92acf64c61\', \'multiverseId\': 586860}, \'multiverseid\': 586860}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ。ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」\\n――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea32293b-2847-4393-9cfd-4cca147244f3\', \'multiverseId\': 586923}, \'multiverseid\': 586923}, {\'name\': \'Botas Pé-ligeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem resistência a magia e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Há grande sabedoria em entrar de cabeça no combate... desde que você esteja preparado."\\n— Kenjek, capitão das Mil Espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6d1e8cb-123f-4b4d-8b91-60418450b2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 587049}, \'multiverseid\': 587049}, {\'name\': \'疾行靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有辟邪与敏捷异能。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「贸然参战乃是智者所为…如果你做好了准备的话。」\\n～千刃团队长肯耶珂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9dc7a63-1753-48f5-a336-236752c5673f\', \'multiverseId\': 587175}, \'multiverseid\': 587175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Test 12: Die Stiefel schützen den Träger jetzt vor allen Gefahren, außer vor Blasen. Muss bessere Einlegesohlen besorgen."\\n—Entwicklungsprotokoll von Willa, yotische Kunsthandwerkerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'438da0dd-ada4-4886-8844-1d7cf4d89175\', \'multiverseId\': 587364}, \'multiverseid\': 587364}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Prueba 12: Ahora las botas protegen a quien se las pone de todos los peligros, a excepción de las ampollas. Hay que conseguir plantillas mejores".\\n—Cuaderno de desarrollo de Willa, artífice yotiana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b2fa59e-9379-4424-850e-48fc3fc0d5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 587427}, \'multiverseid\': 587427}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'« Test 12 : les bottes protègent maintenant le porteur de tous les dangers, excepté les ampoules. Nous devons faire fabriquer de meilleures semelles. »\\n—Journal de développement de Willa, artificier yotien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e433ee2-cc3f-4da4-b618-d01bd2c29835\', \'multiverseId\': 587490}, \'multiverseid\': 587490}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Test 12: gli stivali ora proteggono chi li indossa da ogni pericolo, tranne le vesciche. Servono suole più comode."\\n—Diario di sviluppo di Willa, artefice di Yotia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfbc8262-a3a0-4c5d-baf7-6437e7fdc961\', \'multiverseId\': 587553}, \'multiverseid\': 587553}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「実験12：ブーツは水膨れを除きあらゆる危険から着用者を守る。上等な中敷きを調達する必要あり。」\\n――ヨーティアの工匠、ウィラの開発日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5733bc-023b-4f39-989d-27553f712577\', \'multiverseId\': 587616}, \'multiverseid\': 587616}, {\'name\': \'Botas Pé-ligeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem resistência a magia e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Teste 12: As botas agora protegem o usuário de todo perigo, exceto bolhas. Precisamos de fornecedores de palmilhas melhores."\\n— registro de desenvolvimento de Willa, artífice de Yotia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98b0def1-a7f3-491d-a9b6-88c8a219c305\', \'multiverseId\': 587742}, \'multiverseid\': 587742}, {\'name\': \'疾行靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有辟邪与敏捷异能。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「测试12：现在靴子能够保护穿戴者免受外来伤害，但仍会起水泡。还需要去找更好的内垫。」\\n～佑天神器师薇拉的开发日志\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d82e2a-2163-4ce5-87ad-49025c0abe6f\', \'multiverseId\': 587805}, \'multiverseid\': 587805}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüssigmetallanstrich\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einem Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie werden sich schnell daran gewöhnen, eine Haut zu tragen, die nicht ihre eigene ist."\\n—Elesh Norn, Hohe Zönobitin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586641&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fba62eb-ce0c-4f7b-9314-3ad9d17fab18\', \'multiverseId\': 586641}, \'multiverseid\': 586641}, {\'name\': \'Capa de metal líquido\', \'text\': \'{T}: El permanente objetivo se convierte en un artefacto además de sus otros tipos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Pronto se acostumbrarán a llevar una piel que no es la propia."\\n—Elesh Norn, Gran Cenobita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e62455-3af2-4466-b1d4-a412122419a8\', \'multiverseId\': 586704}, \'multiverseid\': 586704}, {\'name\': \'Revêtement de métal liquide\', \'text\': "{T} : Un permanent ciblé devient un artefact en plus de ses autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Ils s\'habitueront bientôt à porter une peau qui n\'est pas la leur. »\\n—Elesh Norn, Grand Cénobite", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50985723-6db0-4439-9c23-25c643570f51\', \'multiverseId\': 586767}, \'multiverseid\': 586767}, {\'name\': \'Rivestimento di Liquimetallo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Un permanente bersaglio diventa un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si abitueranno molto presto a indossare una pelle che non è la loro."\\n—Elesh Norn, Grande Cenobita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'628ebfa3-dc79-4007-b7d8-35206d8aac1a\', \'multiverseId\': 586830}, \'multiverseid\': 586830}, {\'name\': \'液鋼の塗膜\', \'text\': \'{T}：パーマネント１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らもすぐに、自分のものでない皮膚を着ることに慣れることでしょう。」\\n――大修道士、エリシュ・ノーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1ce2d5-8a22-48ad-b98f-3ebfa035d6d8\', \'multiverseId\': 586893}, \'multiverseid\': 586893}, {\'name\': \'Revestimento Liquometálico\', \'text\': \'{T}: A permanente alvo torna-se um artefato, além de seus outros tipos, até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles logo se acostumarão a usar uma pele que não é deles."\\n— Elesh Norn, Cenobita-Mor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e79f95-fa83-4c31-9cc1-8ae327d10b31\', \'multiverseId\': 587019}, \'multiverseid\': 587019}, {\'name\': \'液金包覆\', \'text\': \'{T}：直到回合结束，目标永久物成为神器，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「他们很快就会习惯穿戴着不属于自己的皮肤。」\\n～大修道士艾蕾侬\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6445b38d-8e4e-44e6-91fa-f55f1813617d\', \'multiverseId\': 587145}, \'multiverseid\': 587145}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüssigmetallanstrich\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einem Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben bei der fünften Iteration einen Durchbruch erzielt. Die Haut des Probanden wurde innerhalb einer Stunde vollständig ersetzt, und er hat danach noch einen ganzen Tag überlebt!"\\n—Ashnod, an Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7db8d57-170c-471d-83bf-a1986968092d\', \'multiverseId\': 587334}, \'multiverseid\': 587334}, {\'name\': \'Capa de metal líquido\', \'text\': \'{T}: El permanente objetivo se convierte en un artefacto además de sus otros tipos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Obtuvimos resultados al quinto intento. La piel del sujeto se sustituyó por completo en una hora, ¡y sobrevivió un día entero!".\\n—Ashnod, a Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b16b937-0c31-4333-94ae-c2ca71b5f9fa\', \'multiverseId\': 587397}, \'multiverseid\': 587397}, {\'name\': \'Revêtement de métal liquide\', \'text\': "{T} : Un permanent ciblé devient un artefact en plus de ses autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons fait une découverte capitale lors de la cinquième itération. La peau du sujet a été entièrement remplacée en une heure, et il a survécu une journée entière ! »\\n—Ashnod, à Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b17992-3bf9-41fe-8d2d-c0f6a55d77d4\', \'multiverseId\': 587460}, \'multiverseid\': 587460}, {\'name\': \'Rivestimento di Liquimetallo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Un permanente bersaglio diventa un artefatto in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La quinta iterazione ha rappresentato il punto di svolta. La pelle del soggetto è stata sostituita interamente in un\\\'ora, ed è sopravvissuto per un intero giorno!"\\n—Ashnod a Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93261d30-fab4-4413-a0f3-f6dcde5c760d\', \'multiverseId\': 587523}, \'multiverseid\': 587523}, {\'name\': \'液鋼の塗膜\', \'text\': \'{T}：パーマネント１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは他のタイプに加えてアーティファクトになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「五回目の反復で飛躍的進展が見られました。一時間で被験体の皮膚と完全に入れ替わり、その状態で丸一日生き延びていたのです！」\\n――アシュノッドからミシュラへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73a0dd7-9970-42f4-9c56-ecd224c73db5\', \'multiverseId\': 587586}, \'multiverseid\': 587586}, {\'name\': \'Revestimento Liquometálico\', \'text\': \'{T}: A permanente alvo torna-se um artefato, além de seus outros tipos, até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Tivemos um avanço na quinta iteração. A pele do espécime foi totalmente substituída em uma hora e ele sobreviveu um dia inteiro depois disso!"\\n— Ashnod, para Mishra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c39fc5-1723-4a86-be59-2af77b9cafcf\', \'multiverseId\': 587712}, \'multiverseid\': 587712}, {\'name\': \'液金包覆\', \'text\': \'{T}：直到回合结束，目标永久物成为神器，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我们在第五次试验时有了突破。实验对象的皮肤在一小时内就被完全取代，且他在此之后还活了一整天！」\\n～阿士诺告诉米斯拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36810a95-b1fb-4630-9fec-467b3b53128a\', \'multiverseId\': 587775}, \'multiverseid\': 587775}]', '[{\'name\': \'Formbarer Stahl\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Formbaren Stahl als Kopie eines beliebigen Artefakts im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Tüftler lagerte eine Stange davon in einem Verlies voller Münzen. Bisher hat er sie noch nicht wiederfinden können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586663&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd6b098-92f6-4dfa-ab90-1c584c09c278\', \'multiverseId\': 586663}, \'multiverseid\': 586663}, {\'name\': \'Acero esculpido\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Acero esculpido entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier artefacto en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un artífice dejó caer uno en una bóveda llena de monedas. Todavía está buscándolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb98dd21-dfa1-4f5e-8a05-761f8fe8bfa5\', \'multiverseId\': 586726}, \'multiverseid\': 586726}, {\'name\': \'Acier sculpteur\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Acier sculpteur arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quel artefact sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Une artificière en a laissé tomber un dans un coffre rempli de pièces de cuivre... Elle l\'y cherche encore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586789&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b207505f-205e-4a3e-bd29-af028033445c\', \'multiverseId\': 586789}, \'multiverseid\': 586789}, {\'name\': \'Acciaio da Scolpire\', \'text\': "Puoi far entrare l\'Acciaio da Scolpire nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi artefatto sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Un\'artefice una volta ne fece cadere uno in una stanza piena di monete. Deve ancora ritrovarlo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a687dca5-01e5-4371-bbd9-8cda8fdaaf50\', \'multiverseId\': 586852}, \'multiverseid\': 586852}, {\'name\': \'彫り込み鋼\', \'text\': \'あなたは彫り込み鋼を、戦場にあるアーティファクト１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ある時、一人の工匠がこいつを金貨の倉庫に落とした。彼女は未だにそれを見つけられていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9608eb-0fe8-44b3-89aa-03c38d530ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 586915}, \'multiverseid\': 586915}, {\'name\': \'Aço Esculpível\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Aço Esculpível entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de qualquer artefato no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Uma vez, uma artífice derrubou um desses num cofre cheio de moedas. Não achou até hoje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed4b6fd6-646b-4fef-b396-31d6829ec4a7\', \'multiverseId\': 587041}, \'multiverseid\': 587041}, {\'name\': \'塑型钢\', \'text\': \'你可以使塑型钢当成战场上任一神器的复制品来进入战场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'某位神器师不慎把它掉落在摆满钱币的地窖中。她到现在还没能把它找出来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb3a846c-8532-4bb0-936e-71f8ec797504\', \'multiverseId\': 587167}, \'multiverseid\': 587167}]', '[{\'name\': \'Formbarer Stahl\', \'text\': \'Du kannst den Formbaren Stahl als Kopie eines beliebigen Artefakts im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ausgehend von seiner frühen Arbeit mit Urlehm hat Tawnos die seltenen Metalle der Erde zu selbstorganisierenden Strängen veredelt."\\n—*Nach dem Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587356&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8962a90-a53d-4ad8-93ce-2a839cfa0a40\', \'multiverseId\': 587356}, \'multiverseid\': 587356}, {\'name\': \'Acero esculpido\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Acero esculpido entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier artefacto en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Según sus primeros estudios del barro primordial, Tawnos refinó los metales raros de la tierra y los convirtió en hilos autoensambladores".\\n—*Tras la guerra*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffc3efe0-d1e3-482b-b8d0-63600fb68e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 587419}, \'multiverseid\': 587419}, {\'name\': \'Acier sculpteur\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Acier sculpteur arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quel artefact sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« En se basant sur ses études de l\'argile primordiale, Tavnos raffina les métaux rares présents dans la terre en filaments auto-assemblables. »\\n—*Après la guerre*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca9aa0e-c74e-4984-be67-51b1c80807c4\', \'multiverseId\': 587482}, \'multiverseid\': 587482}, {\'name\': \'Acciaio da Scolpire\', \'text\': "Puoi far entrare l\'Acciaio da Scolpire nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi artefatto sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Basandosi sulle sue prime creazioni di argilla primordiale, Tawnos ha raffinato i metalli rari della terra in filamenti auto-assemblanti."\\n—*Dopo la Guerra*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fef4d036-c686-43e6-8e28-d4002121f21c\', \'multiverseId\': 587545}, \'multiverseid\': 587545}, {\'name\': \'彫り込み鋼\', \'text\': \'あなたは彫り込み鋼を、戦場にあるアーティファクト１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「タウノスは初期の原始的な粘土作品を土台として、地中の希少金属を自己組立型のひもへと精錬した。」\\n――*「戦争の後に」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3be62cf5-58eb-4cad-8d94-7dc684690c21\', \'multiverseId\': 587608}, \'multiverseid\': 587608}, {\'name\': \'Aço Esculpível\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Aço Esculpível entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de qualquer artefato no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Com base em seu trabalho anterior com argila primal, Tawnos refinou os metais raros da terra em fios automontantes."\\n— *Depois da Guerra*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07f33f0-e7c1-44f5-af62-805c9081f23e\', \'multiverseId\': 587734}, \'multiverseid\': 587734}, {\'name\': \'塑型钢\', \'text\': \'你可以使塑型钢当成战场上任一神器的复制品来进入战场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「达硌士根据他对未塑型黏土的早期研究，将大地中的稀有金属精炼为能够自组成型的丝缕。」\\n～*《战事后记》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39796ef3-6a2d-4410-8984-68bf9910768c\', \'multiverseId\': 587797}, \'multiverseid\': 587797}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frühlingsblättertrommel\', \'text\': \'{T}, tappe eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Musik ist in der Trommel. Ich locke sie nur heraus, damit sie gehört werden kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586668&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'796b806c-cab5-4c71-8d4a-700cacdd6b53\', \'multiverseId\': 586668}, \'multiverseid\': 586668}, {\'name\': \'Tambor de hoja primaveral\', \'text\': \'{T}, girar una criatura enderezada que controlas: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La música está en el tambor. Yo solo hago que se escuche".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86aa6563-2994-40d3-b876-8c4b90b22dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 586731}, \'multiverseid\': 586731}, {\'name\': \'Tambour de sautefeuille\', \'text\': \'{T}, engagez une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« La musique est dans le tambour. Je ne fais que l\'amadouer pour qu\'elle soit entendue. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2587ae60-7bf6-456d-8acd-f4652fd75811\', \'multiverseId\': 586794}, \'multiverseid\': 586794}, {\'name\': \'Tamburo Foglia di Primavera\', \'text\': \'{T}, TAPpa una creatura STAPpata che controlli: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La musica è racchiusa nel tamburo. Io la convinco semplicemente a uscire perché sia udita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95852cf0-df2b-4354-a1c3-3c750aed8968\', \'multiverseId\': 586857}, \'multiverseid\': 586857}, {\'name\': \'バネ葉の太鼓\', \'text\': \'{T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー１体をタップする：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「音楽は太鼓の中にある。私はそれが聞こえるように、外に誘導しているだけに過ぎん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d88107ec-4fba-4cbc-a6ef-8cc83090bb98\', \'multiverseId\': 586920}, \'multiverseid\': 586920}, {\'name\': \'Tambor das Folhas Vernais\', \'text\': \'{T}, vire uma criatura desvirada que você controla: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A música está dentro do tambor. Eu simplesmente a convenço a sair para ser ouvida."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf624b7-fbdd-4ce5-91b2-4162320bac77\', \'multiverseId\': 587046}, \'multiverseid\': 587046}, {\'name\': \'春叶鼓\', \'text\': \'{T}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的生物：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「音乐就在鼓里。我只是诱哄它出来给人听。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ee57bc-1672-435e-a867-e2db56984262\', \'multiverseId\': 587172}, \'multiverseid\': 587172}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frühlingsblättertrommel\', \'text\': \'{T}, tappe eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Weder die Art der Blätter noch die Dicke der Äste erzeugen Musik. Das Lied von Gaea steckt bereits in der Trommel."\\n—Gamelen, Altdruide der Citanul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a8405b-d534-42f6-89c3-e682fc1ad62f\', \'multiverseId\': 587361}, \'multiverseid\': 587361}, {\'name\': \'Tambor de hoja primaveral\', \'text\': \'{T}, girar una criatura enderezada que controlas: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que crea la música no es ni el tipo de hoja ni el grosor de las ramas. La canción de Gaia se encuentra en el tambor".\\n—Gámelen, anciano de Citanul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b860ecf6-7a74-4767-813a-7d4b6a9fdefc\', \'multiverseId\': 587424}, \'multiverseid\': 587424}, {\'name\': \'Tambour de sautefeuille\', \'text\': \'{T}, engagez une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est ni l\'espèce de la feuille ni l\'épaisseur de la branche qui créent la musique. Le chant de Gaia est déjà présent dans le tambour. »\\n—Gamelen, doyen de Citalune", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5eeaaff-3b77-404c-8764-16ca1f47e8c6\', \'multiverseId\': 587487}, \'multiverseid\': 587487}, {\'name\': \'Tamburo Foglia di Primavera\', \'text\': \'{T}, TAPpa una creatura STAPpata che controlli: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La musica non dipende né dalla specie di foglia né dallo spessore del ramo. Il tamburo contiene già il canto di Gea."\\n—Gamelen, anziano di Citanul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c83749b-6469-4486-9b04-ce3f130b41b4\', \'multiverseId\': 587550}, \'multiverseid\': 587550}, {\'name\': \'バネ葉の太鼓\', \'text\': \'{T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー１体をタップする：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「音楽を創るのは葉の種類でも枝の太さでもない。ガイアの歌は既に太鼓に宿っている。」\\n――シタヌールの古老、ガメレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e17aef43-53f2-4de7-8fd2-65cf2c8ff301\', \'multiverseId\': 587613}, \'multiverseid\': 587613}, {\'name\': \'Tambor das Folhas Vernais\', \'text\': \'{T}, vire uma criatura desvirada que você controla: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é a espécie de folha nem o diâmetro do galho que faz a música. A música de Gaia já está no tambor."\\n— Gamelen, ancião de Citanul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c5b0f1-2f68-4d4d-b1f4-1d73caae78a8\', \'multiverseId\': 587739}, \'multiverseid\': 587739}, {\'name\': \'春叶鼓\', \'text\': \'{T}，横置一个由你操控且未横置的生物：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「音乐的来源既非茂叶，亦非繁枝。盖亚之歌早已融于鼓中。」\\n～西坦努长者盖美伦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9743df2f-6727-43bd-958b-330cd4ea4292\', \'multiverseId\': 587802}, \'multiverseid\': 587802}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch\', \'text\': \'{T}, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch: Hellsicht 1.\\n{2}, {T}, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nWenn vier oder mehr Seitenmarken auf dem Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch liegen, schicke es ins Exil. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586643&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd905932-0941-4bb2-82a1-1f1b713f5823\', \'multiverseId\': 586643}, \'multiverseid\': 586643}, {\'name\': \'Tomo pierdementes\', \'text\': \'{T}, poner un contador de página sobre el Tomo pierdementes: Adivina 1.\\n{2}, {T}, poner un contador de página sobre el Tomo pierdementes: Roba una carta.\\nCuando haya cuatro o más contadores de página sobre el Tomo pierdementes, exílialo. Si lo haces, ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48201bbf-3d40-4ac3-bf9e-4b96bdef9542\', \'multiverseId\': 586706}, \'multiverseid\': 586706}, {\'name\': "Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Regard 1.\\n{2},{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.\\nQuand il y a au moins quatre marqueurs « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit, exilez-le. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac88dd5a-999e-43c8-8b58-4772065541d6\', \'multiverseId\': 586769}, \'multiverseid\': 586769}, {\'name\': \'Tomo Cervellotico\', \'text\': \'{T}, Metti un segnalino pagina sul Tomo Cervellotico: Profetizza 1.\\n{2}, {T}, Metti un segnalino pagina sul Tomo Cervellotico: Pesca una carta.\\nQuando ci sono quattro o più segnalini pagina sul Tomo Cervellotico, esilialo. Se lo fai, guadagni 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2867425d-1cae-4779-99bc-272399753ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 586832}, \'multiverseid\': 586832}, {\'name\': \'精神迷わせの秘本\', \'text\': \'{T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く：占術１を行う。\\n{2}, {T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く：カード１枚を引く。\\n精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンターが４個以上あるとき、これを追放する。そうしたなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800b9409-4eef-4eb5-a8ff-b2724ddd225d\', \'multiverseId\': 586895}, \'multiverseid\': 586895}, {\'name\': \'Tomo da Mente Labiríntica\', \'text\': \'{T}, coloque um marcador de página em Tomo da Mente Labiríntica: Use vidência 1.\\n{2}, {T}, coloque um marcador de página em Tomo da Mente Labiríntica: Compre um card.\\nQuando houver quatro ou mais marcadores de página em Tomo da Mente Labiríntica, exile-o. Se fizer isso, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3e8bb54-fbbb-4bf4-a8b7-3bfc192e34d2\', \'multiverseId\': 587021}, \'multiverseid\': 587021}, {\'name\': \'晦涩巨著\', \'text\': \'{T}，在晦涩巨著上放置一个书页指示物：占卜1。\\n{2}，{T}，在晦涩巨著上放置一个书页指示物：抓一张牌。\\n当晦涩巨著上有四个或更多书页指示物时，将它放逐。若你如此作，则你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b31a1f06-5e41-4463-b135-64ebc527e72d\', \'multiverseId\': 587147}, \'multiverseid\': 587147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch\', \'text\': \'{T}, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch: Hellsicht 1.\\n{2}, {T}, lege eine Seitenmarke auf das Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nWenn vier oder mehr Seitenmarken auf dem Gedankenlabyrinth-Zauberbuch liegen, schicke es ins Exil. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587336&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4cb913-0fe9-48b5-bf63-49fe8ef43786\', \'multiverseId\': 587336}, \'multiverseid\': 587336}, {\'name\': \'Tomo pierdementes\', \'text\': \'{T}, poner un contador de página sobre el Tomo pierdementes: Adivina 1.\\n{2}, {T}, poner un contador de página sobre el Tomo pierdementes: Roba una carta.\\nCuando haya cuatro o más contadores de página sobre el Tomo pierdementes, exílialo. Si lo haces, ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e162fafb-6e90-4015-9eb5-1d032783018f\', \'multiverseId\': 587399}, \'multiverseid\': 587399}, {\'name\': "Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Regard 1.\\n{2},{T}, mettez un marqueur « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.\\nQuand il y a au moins quatre marqueurs « page » sur le Grimoire du dédale de l\'esprit, exilez-le. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f099ea29-6e13-4c17-bc27-293df968ebd6\', \'multiverseId\': 587462}, \'multiverseid\': 587462}, {\'name\': \'Tomo Cervellotico\', \'text\': \'{T}, Metti un segnalino pagina sul Tomo Cervellotico: Profetizza 1.\\n{2}, {T}, Metti un segnalino pagina sul Tomo Cervellotico: Pesca una carta.\\nQuando ci sono quattro o più segnalini pagina sul Tomo Cervellotico, esilialo. Se lo fai, guadagni 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2853a1ee-5ecc-468c-b0a7-734d220ad9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 587525}, \'multiverseid\': 587525}, {\'name\': \'精神迷わせの秘本\', \'text\': \'{T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く：占術１を行う。\\n{2}, {T}, 精神迷わせの秘本の上にページ・カウンター１個を置く：カード１枚を引く。\\n精神迷わせの秘本の上に４個以上のページ・カウンターがあるとき、これを追放する。そうしたなら、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac95ac60-23e0-45b2-a2e5-f9b060ff44e8\', \'multiverseId\': 587588}, \'multiverseid\': 587588}, {\'name\': \'Tomo da Mente Labiríntica\', \'text\': \'{T}, coloque um marcador de página em Tomo da Mente Labiríntica: Use vidência 1.\\n{2}, {T}, coloque um marcador de página em Tomo da Mente Labiríntica: Compre um card.\\nQuando houver quatro ou mais marcadores de página em Tomo da Mente Labiríntica, exile-o. Se fizer isso, você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9717cf9f-67fe-489d-9ea1-d1ba2fe00ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 587714}, \'multiverseid\': 587714}, {\'name\': \'晦涩巨著\', \'text\': \'{T}，在晦涩巨著上放置一个书页指示物：占卜1。\\n{2}，{T}，在晦涩巨著上放置一个书页指示物：抓一张牌。\\n当晦涩巨著上有四个或更多书页指示物时，将它放逐。若你如此作，则你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661f2988-adb2-428d-83d2-da8b88632e72\', \'multiverseId\': 587777}, \'multiverseid\': 587777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefährliches Behältnis\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, schicke das Gefährliche Behältnis ins Exil: Schicke alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der Geisterdrache Ugin ordnete die Polyeder von Zendikar an, um Energieströme in Ley-Linien zu bündeln. Eine davon zu unterbrechen bedeutet, Vernichtung und Chaos zu entfesseln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e814f0a-76f6-4f38-871a-322c8aeb1da6\', \'multiverseId\': 586651}, \'multiverseid\': 586651}, {\'name\': \'Bóveda peligrosa\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exiliar la Bóveda peligrosa: Exilia todos los permanentes que no sean tierra.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El dragón espíritu Ugin organizó los edros de Zendikar para canalizar líneas místicas de energía. Manipular uno de ellos es desatar la devastación y el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ebf943-e759-4f1d-8953-dc1fb6d9513c\', \'multiverseId\': 586714}, \'multiverseid\': 586714}, {\'name\': \'Caveau du péril\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exilez le Caveau du péril : Exilez tous les permanents non-terrain.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Ugin le dragon-esprit orienta les hèdrons de Zendikar pour canaliser les lignes ley d\'énergie. En perturber un déclencherait dévastation et chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ad90c9-cf53-451d-ae9e-6f474cdc1fca\', \'multiverseId\': 586777}, \'multiverseid\': 586777}, {\'name\': \'Ricettacolo Pericoloso\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, Esilia il Ricettacolo Pericoloso: Esilia tutti i permanenti non terra.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Lo spirito drago Ugin dispose gli edri di Zendikar per incanalarne le leyline energetiche. Disturbarne uno significa scatenare devastazione e caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'884e5860-1f32-4fcc-9481-ccfa54c30019\', \'multiverseId\': 586840}, \'multiverseid\': 586840}, {\'name\': \'危険な櫃\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, 危険な櫃を追放する：土地でないすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'精霊龍ウギンはエネルギーの力線を誘導させるためにゼンディカーの面晶体を編成した。それを乱すことは、破壊と混乱を解き放つことを意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9c4c526-515b-4685-9c25-0168fccef8e7\', \'multiverseId\': 586903}, \'multiverseid\': 586903}, {\'name\': \'Câmara Perigosa\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exile Câmara Perigosa: Exile todas as permanentes não de terreno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O espírito dragão Ugin organizou os edros de Zendikar para direcionar a energia das linhas de força. Destruir um significa liberar devastação e caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7f338a1-4f19-486f-8f3e-c64393d79f53\', \'multiverseId\': 587029}, \'multiverseid\': 587029}, {\'name\': \'险恶贮窖\', \'text\': \'{5}，{T}，放逐险恶贮窖：放逐所有非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡每一块晶石的位置都经过灵龙乌金的仔细调整，以引导地脉之中的能量流动。打乱其中一块就会引发灾难与混乱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878fb0f6-1bf0-4105-9049-eecac4164be7\', \'multiverseId\': 587155}, \'multiverseid\': 587155}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefährliches Behältnis\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, schicke das Gefährliche Behältnis ins Exil: Schicke alle bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Später wandte Urza sein Augenmerk von den Thran auf Welten jenseits seiner eigenen, auf der Suche nach mächtigen Zaubern oder Technologien, um die Phyrexianer zu besiegen."\\n—*Urza: Vom Wunderkind zum Planeswalker*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878c6aed-f5dc-4320-b0b1-fd9843c59b49\', \'multiverseId\': 587344}, \'multiverseid\': 587344}, {\'name\': \'Bóveda peligrosa\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exiliar la Bóveda peligrosa: Exilia todos los permanentes que no sean tierra.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"A medida que pasaban los años, Urza dejó de lado a los thran para centrarse en otros mundos, en busca de un hechizo o tecnología que pudiera destruir la calamidad pirexiana".\\n—*Urza, de prodigio a planeswalker*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b66e6b7a-0026-49ef-8619-30582997aadb\', \'multiverseId\': 587407}, \'multiverseid\': 587407}, {\'name\': \'Caveau du péril\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exilez le Caveau du péril : Exilez tous les permanents non-terrain.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Avec le temps, Urza oublia les Thrans pour se concentrer sur d\'autres mondes au-delà du sien, à la recherche de sorts ou de technologies qui pourraient détruire le fléau phyrexian. »\\n—*Urza : du prodige au Planeswalker*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a4439ab-9ac1-4fc2-ac7e-9accb9df7034\', \'multiverseId\': 587470}, \'multiverseid\': 587470}, {\'name\': \'Ricettacolo Pericoloso\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, Esilia il Ricettacolo Pericoloso: Esilia tutti i permanenti non terra.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Col passare degli anni, Urza spostò la sua attenzione dai Thran ai mondi esterni, in cerca di magie o tecnologie che potessero schiacciare la piaga Phyrexiana."\\n—*Urza: da prodigio a planeswalker*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deea3636-d66d-4c41-9319-efe115aa2bef\', \'multiverseId\': 587533}, \'multiverseid\': 587533}, {\'name\': \'危険な櫃\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, 危険な櫃を追放する：土地でないすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「年を重ねると、ウルザはスランから外の世界へと注意を向け、ファイレクシアの災いを破る呪文や技術を探すようになった。」\\n――*「ウルザ：神童からプレインズウォーカーへ」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1304488-2e55-4aa9-9201-c928b4e18c0f\', \'multiverseId\': 587596}, \'multiverseid\': 587596}, {\'name\': \'Câmara Perigosa\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}, exile Câmara Perigosa: Exile todas as permanentes não de terreno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Com o passar dos anos, Urza mudou seu foco dos thran para mundos além do dele, à procura de qualquer mágica ou tecnologia capaz de sobrepujar o flagelo phyrexiano."\\n— *Urza: De Prodígio a Planeswalker*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52815da0-e1f8-4ddd-a00f-ab2b64783cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 587722}, \'multiverseid\': 587722}, {\'name\': \'险恶贮窖\', \'text\': \'{5}，{T}，放逐险恶贮窖：放逐所有非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「随着岁月流逝，克撒逐渐超越索蓝放眼其他世界，寻找能够平息非瑞克西亚灾祸的咒文或技术。」\\n～*《克撒：逸展鹏程》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c178ed6-eceb-426b-9f20-f858a62734b6\', \'multiverseId\': 587785}, \'multiverseid\': 587785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gießerei-Inspektor\', \'text\': \'Artefaktzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Maschineninspektoren sorgen dafür, dass die strengen Vorschriften des Konsulats für die Massenproduktion eingehalten werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f96deeb-8891-491c-be06-b4ae0052adcb\', \'multiverseId\': 586629}, \'multiverseid\': 586629}, {\'name\': \'Inspector de la fundición\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Los inspectores de autómatas garantizan el cumplimiento de las rígidas normas de producción en masa del Consulado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e544213-267a-4fa0-a10e-0e50684332c4\', \'multiverseId\': 586692}, \'multiverseid\': 586692}, {\'name\': \'Inspecteur de la fonderie\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'artefact que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Les auto-inspecteurs s\'assurent que les standards d\'excellence du Consulat en matière de production de masse sont respectés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e09716f-8644-4f50-94ad-701ce9c98c3d\', \'multiverseId\': 586755}, \'multiverseid\': 586755}, {\'name\': \'Ispettore della Fonderia\', \'text\': \'Le magie artefatto che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Gli automi ispettori garantiscono che vengano mantenuti i severi standard imposti dal Consolato per la produzione di massa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2c7ff6-4982-4fa8-8a00-a54f02961bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 586818}, \'multiverseid\': 586818}, {\'name\': \'鋳造所の検査官\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'自動機械の検査官が、領事府の定めた大量生産の厳格な基準を満たしていることを確認する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abc6ab0-31d7-40df-a54f-bbdb18017e45\', \'multiverseId\': 586881}, \'multiverseid\': 586881}, {\'name\': \'Inspetor da Fundição\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de artefato que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Os inspetores autômatos garantem que os padrões rigorosos de produção em massa do Consulado sejam mantidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43371880-d124-4a46-84a9-f46f9bdc5885\', \'multiverseId\': 587007}, \'multiverseid\': 587007}, {\'name\': \'铸造厂监工\', \'text\': \'你施放的神器咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'执政院为大量生产制定了苛刻标准，自动机械监工确保此标准得以严格执行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d4efad3-6908-4a17-a164-a865437c34a1\', \'multiverseId\': 587133}, \'multiverseid\': 587133}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gießerei-Inspektor\', \'text\': \'Artefaktzauber, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ausgestattet mit Resonanzdetektoren, könnte er die Fließbänder nach Verunreinigungen im Metall, losen Schrauben und dem unerwünschten Auftreten von Empfindungsfähigkeit absuchen."\\n—Tawnos, Vorschlag für den Prototyp eines Aufsehers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587322&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af33aaab-7b91-4dad-af74-d2bd01692741\', \'multiverseId\': 587322}, \'multiverseid\': 587322}, {\'name\': \'Inspector de la fundición\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los detectores de resonancias mínimas pueden escanear las cadenas de montaje y encontrar impurezas metálicas, tornillos sueltos y fenómenos extraños de consciencia".\\n—Tawnos, propuesta para el prototipo de supervisor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df6edbe0-c68d-4b23-b659-475b10154d70\', \'multiverseId\': 587385}, \'multiverseid\': 587385}, {\'name\': \'Inspecteur de la fonderie\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'artefact que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "« De délicats détecteurs de résonance pourraient scanner les chaînes de production pour repérer les impuretés métalliques, les écrous mal serrés, et les instances d\'éveil de conscience accidentelles. »\\n—Tavnos, proposition de prototype de brigadier", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86525839-fa84-40a1-bab6-c69a25e24f20\', \'multiverseId\': 587448}, \'multiverseid\': 587448}, {\'name\': \'Ispettore della Fonderia\', \'text\': \'Le magie artefatto che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Dei rilevatori di risonanza sensibili potrebbero esaminare le catene di montaggio in cerca di impurità metalliche, bulloni allentati e i rari casi di acquisizione di coscienza."\\n—Tawnos, proposta per un prototipo di sorvegliante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec4643d-ab92-4d54-87bd-2417cd08ea9b\', \'multiverseId\': 587511}, \'multiverseid\': 587511}, {\'name\': \'鋳造所の検査官\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「高感度の共振検知器により、金属の不純物や緩んだボルト、自我の異常発生を組立ライン上で走査できるようになるでしょう。」\\n――タウノス、監視者の試作品の提案\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2493d87b-f004-4ccf-ab10-9187f6499f69\', \'multiverseId\': 587574}, \'multiverseid\': 587574}, {\'name\': \'Inspetor da Fundição\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de artefato que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Delicados detectores de ressonância poderiam sondar as linhas de montagem e detectar impurezas metálicas, parafusos soltos e ocorrências aberrantes de senciência."\\n— Tawnos, proposta de protótipo de supervisão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33d289bb-8d13-4a60-9044-78881c2c536c\', \'multiverseId\': 587700}, \'multiverseid\': 587700}, {\'name\': \'铸造厂监工\', \'text\': \'你施放的神器咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「这批精巧的共振探测器能够用来扫描装配管线，检查金属杂质、松动螺栓和反常感知现象。」\\n～达硌士，关于试作监督械的提议\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc65dea3-a0cd-445d-8178-ac6d55c98988\', \'multiverseId\': 587763}, \'multiverseid\': 587763}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glanzgeschliffener Hirsch\', \'text\': \'{3}, opfere den Glanzgeschliffenen Hirsch: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'Von Göttern geschmiedet, um unter Sterblichen zu wandeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e59fa96-a961-4d91-9e92-603dd466cbd4\', \'multiverseId\': 586621}, \'multiverseid\': 586621}, {\'name\': \'Venado bruñido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrificar el Venado bruñido: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por manos divinas para deambular por los reinos mortales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427549b5-51a5-485e-afdb-54693c22622c\', \'multiverseId\': 586684}, \'multiverseid\': 586684}, {\'name\': \'Cerf bruni\', \'text\': "{3}, sacrifiez le Cerf bruni : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : élan\', \'flavor\': \'Forgé par des mains divines pour sillonner les royaumes des mortels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67573eee-4b2c-4c5d-8f6b-0cc2c1dbfe07\', \'multiverseId\': 586747}, \'multiverseid\': 586747}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunito\', \'text\': \'{3}, Sacrifica il Cervo Brunito: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forgiato da mani divine per vagare tra i reami mortali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12f0681-4a28-4da5-a2db-6f98f4a12db9\', \'multiverseId\': 586810}, \'multiverseid\': 586810}, {\'name\': \'つややかな雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3},つややかな雄鹿を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'定命の者の世界をさまようため、天界の者の手により創られた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab8019a-421a-4d0a-a1a4-55ecf266f77a\', \'multiverseId\': 586873}, \'multiverseid\': 586873}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrifique Cervo Brunido: Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por mãos divinas para vagar pelos reinos mortais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5130347-0b05-42e5-bb44-5f9fb8f4d84d\', \'multiverseId\': 586999}, \'multiverseid\': 586999}, {\'name\': \'光洁雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}，牺牲光洁雄鹿：从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'由神明之手铸造，在凡人领域游荡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c043a6-c484-4b0a-99a7-9757d2e60832\', \'multiverseId\': 587125}, \'multiverseid\': 587125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glanzgeschliffener Hirsch\', \'text\': \'{3}, opfere den Glanzgeschliffenen Hirsch: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Natur hat unsere Probleme bereits gelöst. Unsere Herausforderung besteht darin, die Eleganz ihrer Lösungen zu reproduzieren."\\n—Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587314&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf852e8-2a6f-41cf-a15e-d18d9abe47e3\', \'multiverseId\': 587314}, \'multiverseid\': 587314}, {\'name\': \'Venado bruñido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrificar el Venado bruñido: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza ya resolvió nuestros problemas. Ahora hay que reproducir la elegancia de sus soluciones".\\n—Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a2ce9d-cc90-4e0b-9ef3-e1e8e5365d41\', \'multiverseId\': 587377}, \'multiverseid\': 587377}, {\'name\': \'Cerf bruni\', \'text\': "{3}, sacrifiez le Cerf bruni : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : élan\', \'flavor\': "« La nature a déjà résolu nos problèmes. Notre défi est de dupliquer l\'élégance de ses solutions. »\\n—Tavnos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587440&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff86bc29-bdd7-4c70-9ee6-5e9d13872c77\', \'multiverseId\': 587440}, \'multiverseid\': 587440}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunito\', \'text\': \'{3}, Sacrifica il Cervo Brunito: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo naturale ha già risolto i nostri problemi. La nostra sfida è riuscire a replicare l\\\'eleganza delle sue soluzioni."\\n—Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'242c9c95-7149-4de9-a802-02dd35d243a9\', \'multiverseId\': 587503}, \'multiverseid\': 587503}, {\'name\': \'つややかな雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3},つややかな雄鹿を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの問題は自然界ではとっくに解決済みである。難題は、解決の華麗なる作法を模倣することである。」\\n――タウノス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f8999a6-ae74-49f1-bf83-971598fe5c08\', \'multiverseId\': 587566}, \'multiverseid\': 587566}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrifique Cervo Brunido: Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"O mundo natural já resolveu os nossos problemas. Nosso desafio é replicar a elegância dessas soluções."\\n— Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c74a46bd-0c7b-4ee6-9ca1-f1cf6264fe92\', \'multiverseId\': 587692}, \'multiverseid\': 587692}, {\'name\': \'光洁雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}，牺牲光洁雄鹿：从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「自然世界已经解决了我们的问题。留下的挑战便是重现这一优雅方案。」\\n～达硌士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98178712-5028-421f-9340-63f26658c351\', \'multiverseId\': 587755}, \'multiverseid\': 587755}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Flammenrülpser\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Länderkarte aufdeckst. Der Goblin-Flammenrülpser fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie auf diese Weise Nichtland-Karten aufgedeckt wurden. Falls die aufgedeckte Länderkarte ein Gebirge war, fügt der Goblin-Flammenrülpser stattdessen doppelt so viel Schaden zu. Lege die aufgedeckten Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e695312-5870-4249-961d-56a7451ed8fd\', \'multiverseId\': 586631}, \'multiverseid\': 586631}, {\'name\': \'Lanzaesquirlas trasgo\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de tierra. El Lanzaesquirlas trasgo hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas que no sean tierra mostradas de esta manera. Si la carta de tierra mostrada es una Montaña, en vez de eso, el Lanzaesquirlas trasgo hace el doble de ese daño. Pon las cartas mostradas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31bfeb2c-1850-4719-b6cc-286673d0b982\', \'multiverseId\': 586694}, \'multiverseid\': 586694}, {\'name\': \'Rotefeu gobelin\', \'text\': "{3}, {T} : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de terrain. Le Rotefeu gobelin inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes non-terrain révélées de cette manière. Si la carte de terrain ainsi révélée était une montagne, le Rotefeu gobelin inflige le double de ces blessures à la place. Mettez les cartes révélées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586757&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed297fd-a760-45db-b970-2e6d34c8c3f3\', \'multiverseId\': 586757}, \'multiverseid\': 586757}, {\'name\': \'Sparafuoco Goblin\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta terra. Lo Sparafuoco Goblin infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte non terra rivelate in questo modo. Se la carta terra rivelata era una Montagna, lo Sparafuoco Goblin infligge invece il doppio di quel danno. Metti le carte rivelate in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a7c0ec6-2c8c-46c1-94e9-1dd0eb028fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 586820}, \'multiverseid\': 586820}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの放火砲\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。土地・カード１枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。ゴブリンの放火砲はそれに、これにより公開されて土地でないカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。公開された土地・カードが山であったなら、ゴブリンの放火砲は代わりにその２倍の点数のダメージを与える。それらの公開されたカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d78c971-d004-43b1-95a0-fc9b6454a137\', \'multiverseId\': 586883}, \'multiverseid\': 586883}, {\'name\': \'Canhão de Fogo dos Goblins\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de terreno. Canhão de Fogo dos Goblins causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards não de terreno revelados desta maneira a qualquer alvo. Se o card de terreno revelado for uma Montanha, em vez disso, Canhão de Fogo dos Goblins causa o dobro daquela quantidade de dano. Coloque os cards revelados no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44bc5d3d-d7be-462d-a0ec-b6f4b9d7d8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 587009}, \'multiverseid\': 587009}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪喷火炮\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}：从你牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止。鬼怪喷火炮对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于以此法展示之非地牌数量。如果展示出的地牌是山脉，则改为鬼怪喷火炮造成两倍的伤害。将所展示的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e7b5af-e96e-4d6c-a83b-e0840b9e1311\', \'multiverseId\': 587135}, \'multiverseid\': 587135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Flammenrülpser\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Länderkarte aufdeckst. Der Goblin-Flammenrülpser fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie auf diese Weise Nichtland-Karten aufgedeckt wurden. Falls die aufgedeckte Länderkarte ein Gebirge war, fügt der Goblin-Flammenrülpser stattdessen doppelt so viel Schaden zu. Lege die aufgedeckten Karten in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587324&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e18582-4dff-41a7-940d-8be7ef6de796\', \'multiverseId\': 587324}, \'multiverseid\': 587324}, {\'name\': \'Lanzaesquirlas trasgo\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Muestra cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de tierra. El Lanzaesquirlas trasgo hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas que no sean tierra mostradas de esta manera. Si la carta de tierra mostrada es una Montaña, en vez de eso, el Lanzaesquirlas trasgo hace el doble de ese daño. Pon las cartas mostradas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da26c47e-6377-437c-85ef-37a795d3650a\', \'multiverseId\': 587387}, \'multiverseid\': 587387}, {\'name\': \'Rotefeu gobelin\', \'text\': "{3}, {T} : Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de terrain. Le Rotefeu gobelin inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes non-terrain révélées de cette manière. Si la carte de terrain ainsi révélée était une montagne, le Rotefeu gobelin inflige le double de ces blessures à la place. Mettez les cartes révélées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b908b13-5309-4f3e-86f7-2e9ecb66d313\', \'multiverseId\': 587450}, \'multiverseid\': 587450}, {\'name\': \'Sparafuoco Goblin\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta terra. Lo Sparafuoco Goblin infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte non terra rivelate in questo modo. Se la carta terra rivelata era una Montagna, lo Sparafuoco Goblin infligge invece il doppio di quel danno. Metti le carte rivelate in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3d1cb1-1053-4556-b554-76724dbc15cf\', \'multiverseId\': 587513}, \'multiverseid\': 587513}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの放火砲\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。土地・カード１枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。ゴブリンの放火砲はそれに、これにより公開されて土地でないカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。公開された土地・カードが山であったなら、ゴブリンの放火砲は代わりにその２倍の点数のダメージを与える。それらの公開されたカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0c73e5-6770-4fab-9593-8638fd219544\', \'multiverseId\': 587576}, \'multiverseid\': 587576}, {\'name\': \'Canhão de Fogo dos Goblins\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de terreno. Canhão de Fogo dos Goblins causa uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards não de terreno revelados desta maneira a qualquer alvo. Se o card de terreno revelado for uma Montanha, em vez disso, Canhão de Fogo dos Goblins causa o dobro daquela quantidade de dano. Coloque os cards revelados no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd429d63-58d8-4030-8ce5-d4a06f41ed0a\', \'multiverseId\': 587702}, \'multiverseid\': 587702}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪喷火炮\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}：从你牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张地牌为止。鬼怪喷火炮对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于以此法展示之非地牌数量。如果展示出的地牌是山脉，则改为鬼怪喷火炮造成两倍的伤害。将所展示的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be52e9b8-91d9-4d3a-8ba5-6946a69a0746\', \'multiverseId\': 587765}, \'multiverseid\': 587765}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golem-Vorläufer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Golem-Vorläufer ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 3/3 farblose Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, der bzw. die nur einen einzelnen Golem als Ziel hat, kopiert der Spieler den Zauberspruch für jeden anderen Golem, den der Zauberspruch als Ziel haben könnte. Jede der Kopien hat einen unterschiedlichen jener Golems als Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586655&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683d928d-2d9f-47b9-adf5-4387f5000c60\', \'multiverseId\': 586655}, \'multiverseid\': 586655}, {\'name\': \'Gólem precursor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gólem precursor entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Gólem incoloras 3/3.\\nSiempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que haga objetivo a un único Gólem, ese jugador copia ese hechizo por cada uno de los otros Gólems que ese hechizo pudiera hacer objetivo. Cada copia hace objetivo a cada uno de esos otros Gólems.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bcd921a-fe2f-4077-b4e7-0a930d82f1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 586718}, \'multiverseid\': 586718}, {\'name\': \'Golem précurseur\', \'text\': "Quand le Golem précurseur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel qui ne cible qu\'un seul golem, ce joueur copie ce sort pour chaque autre golem que ce sort pourrait cibler. Chaque copie cible un de ces golems différents.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c70218-5d6f-482a-a012-c449c25668f0\', \'multiverseId\': 586781}, \'multiverseid\': 586781}, {\'name\': \'Predecessore Golem\', \'text\': \'Quando il Predecessore Golem entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolori.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria che bersaglia solo un Golem, quel giocatore copia quella magia per ogni altro Golem che quella magia potrebbe bersagliare. Ogni copia bersaglia uno diverso di quei Golem.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5b3cc8-4297-4722-9d59-86ca8e5600ca\', \'multiverseId\': 586844}, \'multiverseid\': 586844}, {\'name\': \'先駆のゴーレム\', \'text\': \'先駆のゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nプレイヤー１人がゴーレム１体のみを対象としてインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーはその呪文を、その呪文が対象にできてそれでないゴーレム１体につき１回コピーする。それぞれのコピーは、それらのゴーレムのうち別々のものを対象とする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f578b8c-10a0-42c4-9209-661568166ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 586907}, \'multiverseid\': 586907}, {\'name\': \'Golem Precursor\', \'text\': \'Quando Golem Precursor entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato Golem incolor 3/3.\\nToda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço que tem um único Golem como alvo, aquele jogador copia aquela mágica para cada outro Golem que aquela mágica poderia ter como alvo. Cada cópia tem um Golem diferente como alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b50ab93e-bf0f-4400-bf3a-72ad5ecaf88b\', \'multiverseId\': 587033}, \'multiverseid\': 587033}, {\'name\': \'先驱魔像\', \'text\': \'当先驱魔像进战场时，派出两个3/3无色魔像衍生神器生物。\\n每当任一牌手施放仅以单一魔像为目标的瞬间或法术咒语时，该咒语每能以一个其他的魔像为目标，该牌手便将该咒语复制一次。每个复制品都要以这些魔像之一为目标，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'776ac498-da1a-46fb-8679-7aa1640ed813\', \'multiverseId\': 587159}, \'multiverseid\': 587159}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golem-Vorläufer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Golem-Vorläufer ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 3/3 farblose Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, der bzw. die nur einen einzelnen Golem als Ziel hat, kopiert der Spieler den Zauberspruch für jeden anderen Golem, den der Zauberspruch als Ziel haben könnte. Jede der Kopien hat einen unterschiedlichen jener Golems als Ziel.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587348&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33293fe3-dc00-4115-bdee-0458ed6caf70\', \'multiverseId\': 587348}, \'multiverseid\': 587348}, {\'name\': \'Gólem precursor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gólem precursor entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura artefacto Gólem incoloras 3/3.\\nSiempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que haga objetivo a un único Gólem, ese jugador copia ese hechizo por cada uno de los otros Gólems que ese hechizo pudiera hacer objetivo. Cada copia hace objetivo a cada uno de esos otros Gólems.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ae78295-1cf2-41a4-b918-9e93b218f4fc\', \'multiverseId\': 587411}, \'multiverseid\': 587411}, {\'name\': \'Golem précurseur\', \'text\': "Quand le Golem précurseur arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel qui ne cible qu\'un seul golem, ce joueur copie ce sort pour chaque autre golem que ce sort pourrait cibler. Chaque copie cible un de ces golems différents.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d170367b-cffb-41b3-982c-4ab347092632\', \'multiverseId\': 587474}, \'multiverseid\': 587474}, {\'name\': \'Predecessore Golem\', \'text\': \'Quando il Predecessore Golem entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolori.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria che bersaglia solo un Golem, quel giocatore copia quella magia per ogni altro Golem che quella magia potrebbe bersagliare. Ogni copia bersaglia uno diverso di quei Golem.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c18d79b9-7699-4f5a-9dcf-d78c222c35e4\', \'multiverseId\': 587537}, \'multiverseid\': 587537}, {\'name\': \'先駆のゴーレム\', \'text\': \'先駆のゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nプレイヤー１人がゴーレム１体のみを対象としてインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーはその呪文を、その呪文が対象にできてそれでないゴーレム１体につき１回コピーする。それぞれのコピーは、それらのゴーレムのうち別々のものを対象とする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c15a8d2-5dd2-4040-adfc-9ac9379e67a4\', \'multiverseId\': 587600}, \'multiverseid\': 587600}, {\'name\': \'Golem Precursor\', \'text\': \'Quando Golem Precursor entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura artefato Golem incolor 3/3.\\nToda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço que tem um único Golem como alvo, aquele jogador copia aquela mágica para cada outro Golem que aquela mágica poderia ter como alvo. Cada cópia tem um Golem diferente como alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5953aac2-81df-47b2-bf58-c122dad00100\', \'multiverseId\': 587726}, \'multiverseid\': 587726}, {\'name\': \'先驱魔像\', \'text\': \'当先驱魔像进战场时，派出两个3/3无色魔像衍生神器生物。\\n每当任一牌手施放仅以单一魔像为目标的瞬间或法术咒语时，该咒语每能以一个其他的魔像为目标，该牌手便将该咒语复制一次。每个复制品都要以这些魔像之一为目标，且不能重复选择。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fcf8307-6b59-43ee-a5e6-4ec28d6cc63b\', \'multiverseId\': 587789}, \'multiverseid\': 587789}]', '[{\'name\': \'Helm der Schar\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ausgerüsteten Kreatur ist, außer dass der Spielstein nicht legendär ist, falls die ausgerüstete Kreatur legendär ist. Der Spielstein erhält Eile.\\nAusrüsten {5}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd58033-bd6f-45dd-833e-5a092c6ea622\', \'multiverseId\': 586632}, \'multiverseid\': 586632}, {\'name\': \'Yelmo multiplicador\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura equipada, excepto que la ficha no es legendaria si la criatura equipada es legendaria. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa.\\nEquipar {5}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d232498-67e5-4b49-8aa9-63d2cd2f2b45\', \'multiverseId\': 586695}, \'multiverseid\': 586695}, {\'name\': \'Heaume de la multitude\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton qui est une copie de la créature équipée, excepté que le jeton n\'est pas légendaire si la créature équipée est légendaire. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité.\\nÉquipement {5}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586758&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b42e38a-567a-4bc0-9568-c8bf3d349ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 586758}, \'multiverseid\': 586758}, {\'name\': \'Elmo della Moltitudine\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina che è una copia della creatura equipaggiata, tranne che la pedina non è leggendaria se la creatura equipaggiata è leggendaria. Quella pedina ha rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {5}", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89fa0349-70e5-4b9e-97b3-2b30ecd294ea\', \'multiverseId\': 586821}, \'multiverseid\': 586821}, {\'name\': \'多勢の兜\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、装備しているクリーチャーが伝説であるならそのトークンは伝説ではないことを除き、装備しているクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。そのトークンは速攻を得る。\\n装備{5}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0167c66b-77f1-41ad-a5d6-92270d2013b0\', \'multiverseId\': 586884}, \'multiverseid\': 586884}, {\'name\': \'Elmo Multiplicador\', \'text\': \'No início do combate em seu turno, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura equipada, com a exceção de não ser lendária se a criatura equipada for lendária. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto.\\nEquipar {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9236e972-4704-45a2-9b88-4cad46fa5293\', \'multiverseId\': 587010}, \'multiverseid\': 587010}, {\'name\': \'军团之盔\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为佩带此武具之生物的复制品，但如果佩带此武具的生物是传奇，则该衍生物不是传奇。该衍生物获得敏捷异能。\\n佩带{5}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ed07e8-df7a-41a4-9474-e43baf1901ef\', \'multiverseId\': 587136}, \'multiverseid\': 587136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Helm der Schar\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ausgerüsteten Kreatur ist, außer dass der Spielstein nicht legendär ist, falls die ausgerüstete Kreatur legendär ist. Der Spielstein erhält Eile.\\nAusrüsten {5}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87dca7e1-0b6e-41b0-95e4-a098b80f2b75\', \'multiverseId\': 587325}, \'multiverseid\': 587325}, {\'name\': \'Yelmo multiplicador\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura equipada, excepto que la ficha no es legendaria si la criatura equipada es legendaria. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa.\\nEquipar {5}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bebdc12-1a2e-4e4c-9269-789126e05fb0\', \'multiverseId\': 587388}, \'multiverseid\': 587388}, {\'name\': \'Heaume de la multitude\', \'text\': "Au début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton qui est une copie de la créature équipée, excepté que le jeton n\'est pas légendaire si la créature équipée est légendaire. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité.\\nÉquipement {5}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e2e3d4-a885-4945-94ec-3d04a5fec9d0\', \'multiverseId\': 587451}, \'multiverseid\': 587451}, {\'name\': \'Elmo della Moltitudine\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina che è una copia della creatura equipaggiata, tranne che la pedina non è leggendaria se la creatura equipaggiata è leggendaria. Quella pedina ha rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {5}", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e6c07b-2b56-4612-b448-0b50d2ebacda\', \'multiverseId\': 587514}, \'multiverseid\': 587514}, {\'name\': \'多勢の兜\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、装備しているクリーチャーが伝説であるならそのトークンは伝説ではないことを除き、装備しているクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。そのトークンは速攻を得る。\\n装備{5}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca5f133b-eac9-490e-a3fb-8bf70cca96c5\', \'multiverseId\': 587577}, \'multiverseid\': 587577}, {\'name\': \'Elmo Multiplicador\', \'text\': \'No início do combate em seu turno, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia da criatura equipada, com a exceção de não ser lendária se a criatura equipada for lendária. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto.\\nEquipar {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde8ca6b-e100-485d-8b57-b180cd442d63\', \'multiverseId\': 587703}, \'multiverseid\': 587703}, {\'name\': \'军团之盔\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为佩带此武具之生物的复制品，但如果佩带此武具的生物是传奇，则该衍生物不是传奇。该衍生物获得敏捷异能。\\n佩带{5}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61df95f4-de28-431e-b098-de6f28c496b4\', \'multiverseId\': 587766}, \'multiverseid\': 587766}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inneres Auge\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sitze und denke an Lat-Nam und seine azurblauen Wellen. Ich sehe die Energie dort und rufe sie herbei."\\n—Hurkyl, Meditationsnotizen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587339&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c5db32-373c-4968-bfb2-ce2265607f82\', \'multiverseId\': 587339}, \'multiverseid\': 587339}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de la mente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente robe una carta, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sentada, pienso en Lat-Nam y en sus olas cerúleas cuya blanca espuma cubría la orilla. Veo esa energía y la invoco".\\n—Hurkyl, notas de meditación\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79080e27-73d6-46f0-a54a-1239484a1f11\', \'multiverseId\': 587402}, \'multiverseid\': 587402}, {\'name\': "Œil de l\'esprit", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Je pense à Lat-Nam, aux vagues d\'azur blanches d\'écume, suspendues au-dessus du rivage. Je vois l\'énergie et je l\'invoque ici. »\\n—Hurkyl, notes de méditation", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261d6ef2-c2a1-417f-8a05-5a27368bfc1c\', \'multiverseId\': 587465}, \'multiverseid\': 587465}, {\'name\': \'Occhio della Mente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario pesca una carta, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Siedo qui pensando a Lat-Nam, alle azzurre onde punteggiate di schiuma bianca, sospese sulla costa. Vedo la sua energia e la richiamo a me."\\n—Hurkyl, note di meditazione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0993eb75-5891-4fab-a03e-69857a8086d8\', \'multiverseId\': 587528}, \'multiverseid\': 587528}, {\'name\': \'精神の眼\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がカード１枚を引くたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「私は座し、ラト＝ナムを思う。白い泡を纏った紺碧の波が海岸を漂っている。私はエネルギーをそこに認め、この場所に呼び起こす。」\\n――ハーキルの瞑想録\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427909e2-95c7-489c-a641-7e6074b364f4\', \'multiverseId\': 587591}, \'multiverseid\': 587591}, {\'name\': \'Olho da Mente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente compra um card, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sento e penso em Lat-Nam, nas ondas azuis de espuma branca suspensas na costa. Eu vejo a energia lá e a convoco aqui."\\n— Hurkyl, observações de meditação\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14291ba8-6242-4e43-a502-84e3554f4601\', \'multiverseId\': 587717}, \'multiverseid\': 587717}, {\'name\': \'灵眼\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我正姿端坐，思绪回到了拉特南学院，脑海净是翻着洁白浪花的碧蓝海浪冲刷滩头的安稳景象。就在其中，我看到了能量所在，于是我将之召唤至此。」\\n～河鼓，冥思纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228e815f-adce-4985-85ce-1cc668ccc74f\', \'multiverseId\': 587780}, \'multiverseid\': 587780}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inneres Auge\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ideen treiben wie Blätter im Wind. Ich muss nur meinen Kopf in die Brise halten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e28531a4-9593-447f-996d-634cca2d8f93\', \'multiverseId\': 586646}, \'multiverseid\': 586646}, {\'name\': \'Ojo de la mente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente robe una carta, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las ideas flotan como pétalos en el viento. Solo tengo que levantar mi rostro al viento".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'804b8e71-d812-42f7-956f-79ce62f8813d\', \'multiverseId\': 586709}, \'multiverseid\': 586709}, {\'name\': "Œil de l\'esprit", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les idées planent sur le vent comme des pétales. Il me suffit de lever mon visage au vent pour les avoir. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'539fe4ca-851b-42ac-a8f3-d30b66f31a14\', \'multiverseId\': 586772}, \'multiverseid\': 586772}, {\'name\': \'Occhio della Mente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario pesca una carta, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le idee fluttuano come petali al vento. Devo solo volgere la faccia verso la brezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c5e15c8-e0df-4f65-a310-3e4fe432afb0\', \'multiverseId\': 586835}, \'multiverseid\': 586835}, {\'name\': \'精神の眼\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がカード１枚を引くたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「アイデアは風の中の花びらのように移ろうもの。私はその風に顔を向ければいいだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c4613cf-5142-40df-9523-ffa663ae2fd1\', \'multiverseId\': 586898}, \'multiverseid\': 586898}, {\'name\': \'Olho da Mente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um oponente compra um card, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Ideias voam como pétalas ao vento. Eu só preciso levantar o meu rosto até a brisa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246a4319-dc33-40a1-8bd4-e5a90c46ffed\', \'multiverseId\': 587024}, \'multiverseid\': 587024}, {\'name\': \'灵眼\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，你可以支付{1}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「灵思如风中花瓣般飘飞；我只需面朝着微风。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b10f8f98-7cad-441f-bb01-fd8334586224\', \'multiverseId\': 587150}, \'multiverseid\': 587150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierende Statuen\', \'text\': \'Nichtartefakt-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Improvisieren. (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, jene Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Ghirapurs am meisten gefeierte Erfinder wurden als mechanische Konstrukte verewigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce71a437-347e-4cce-9966-1b7899f9bc55\', \'multiverseId\': 586635}, \'multiverseid\': 586635}, {\'name\': \'Estatuas inspiradoras\', \'text\': \'Los hechizos que no sean de artefacto que lances tienen la habilidad de improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar esos hechizos. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los inventores más alabados de Ghirapur están inmortalizados en estatuas de engranajes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18484b8d-b0fa-49b8-a405-20494d6a8b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 586698}, \'multiverseid\': 586698}, {\'name\': \'Statuaire inspiratrice\', \'text\': "Les sorts non-artefact que vous lancez ont l\'improvisation. (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ces sorts. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus illustres inventeurs de Ghirapur ont été immortalisés sous forme mécanique.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bff83796-a249-4af8-b910-3ff1b4eace2c\', \'multiverseId\': 586761}, \'multiverseid\': 586761}, {\'name\': \'Statuaria Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Le magie non artefatto che lanci hanno improvvisare. (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare quelle magie. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I più celebri inventori di Ghirapur sono stati immortalati in forma meccanica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d2832d6-4915-419f-9c1c-d32a188d3444\', \'multiverseId\': 586824}, \'multiverseid\': 586824}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する彫像\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えてアーティファクトでないすべての呪文は即席を持つ。（あなたのアーティファクトが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは{1}を支払う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ギラプール最高の発明者は、機械仕掛けが後世まで讃える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a15f73e-3b93-47b9-86ce-99eea9003127\', \'multiverseId\': 586887}, \'multiverseid\': 586887}, {\'name\': \'Estatuária Inspiradora\', \'text\': \'As mágicas não de artefato que você conjura têm improvisar. (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar essas mágicas. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os inventores mais célebres de Ghirapur foram imortalizados mecanicamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86764afc-a2cc-4774-bca9-f68e5d4dbae6\', \'multiverseId\': 587013}, \'multiverseid\': 587013}, {\'name\': \'启迪塑像\', \'text\': \'你施放的非神器咒语具有拼造异能。（这些咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'金属塑像容貌相似，齿轮运转举止相同：吉拉波各位知名发明家藉此得以永生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9942f7a-f1db-4c1e-81b0-4045938ccb46\', \'multiverseId\': 587139}, \'multiverseid\': 587139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierende Statuen\', \'text\': \'Nichtartefakt-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Improvisieren. (Deine Artefakte können dir helfen, jene Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jedem Artefakt, das du tappst, nachdem du mit dem Aktivieren deiner Manafähigkeiten fertig bist, bezahlst du {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Anfangszeit galten Urzas wundersame Automaten als Symbole der Hoffnung und des Mutes."\\n—*Der Artefakt-Krieg*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a439f4bf-5809-4e6d-a47a-b35012830200\', \'multiverseId\': 587328}, \'multiverseid\': 587328}, {\'name\': \'Estatuas inspiradoras\', \'text\': \'Los hechizos que no sean de artefacto que lances tienen la habilidad de improvisar. (Tus artefactos pueden ayudar a lanzar esos hechizos. Cada artefacto que gires una vez que termines de activar habilidades de maná paga {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Al principio, los asombrosos autómatas de Urza se consideraban símbolos de esperanza y valentía".\\n—*La Guerra de las Antigüedades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23118fbe-c6d4-436e-bcec-563cd63011c6\', \'multiverseId\': 587391}, \'multiverseid\': 587391}, {\'name\': \'Statuaire inspiratrice\', \'text\': "Les sorts non-artefact que vous lancez ont l\'improvisation. (Vos artefacts peuvent aider à lancer ces sorts. Chaque artefact que vous engagez après avoir activé des capacités de mana paie {1}.)", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Au début, les merveilleux automates d\'Urza étaient considérés comme des symboles d\'espoir et de courage. »\\n—*La Guerre des Antiquités*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ddd8fb6-2b0a-4040-88c4-d9b740f96f62\', \'multiverseId\': 587454}, \'multiverseid\': 587454}, {\'name\': \'Statuaria Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Le magie non artefatto che lanci hanno improvvisare. (I tuoi artefatti possono aiutarti a lanciare quelle magie. Ogni artefatto che TAPpi dopo aver attivato le abilità di mana corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"In origine, i meravigliosi automi di Urza erano visti come simboli di speranza e coraggio."\\n—*La Guerra delle Antichità*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de7299f7-5e83-47af-9f6b-b8b8d42648da\', \'multiverseId\': 587517}, \'multiverseid\': 587517}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する彫像\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えてアーティファクトでないすべての呪文は即席を持つ。（あなたのアーティファクトが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。あなたがマナ能力を起動し終えたあとにあなたがタップした各アーティファクトは{1}を支払う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「緒戦期において、ウルザの摩訶不思議な自動機械は希望と勇気の象徴とみなされたのである。」\\n――*「アンティキティー戦争」*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c423a8c-329c-441c-9d2b-2aef08351990\', \'multiverseId\': 587580}, \'multiverseid\': 587580}, {\'name\': \'Estatuária Inspiradora\', \'text\': \'As mágicas não de artefato que você conjura têm improvisar. (Seus artefatos podem ajudar a conjurar essas mágicas. Cada artefato que você vira após terminar de ativar habilidades de mana paga por {1}.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"No começo, os autômatos de Urza eram vistos como símbolos de esperança e coragem."\\n— *A Guerra das Antiguidades*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0fbe930-ed65-499b-acf7-91313afe95a5\', \'multiverseId\': 587706}, \'multiverseid\': 587706}, {\'name\': \'启迪塑像\', \'text\': \'你施放的非神器咒语具有拼造异能。（这些咒语能用你的神器来协助施放。你起动完法术力异能之后每横置一个神器，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「早期，克撒的神奇自动机械被当作希望与勇气的象征。」\\n～*《古文明之战》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7310732f-f938-4f39-a691-c38f79f7172d\', \'multiverseId\': 587769}, \'multiverseid\': 587769}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klagender Stein\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt X Karten, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten im Friedhof jenes Spielers ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Während er sich dreht, kreischen tote Stimmen in einem immer lauter werdenden Missklang und bringen den Kopf zum Platzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586639&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708bf889-fe39-4885-8bc7-e8e62308b5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 586639}, \'multiverseid\': 586639}, {\'name\': \'Piedra atormentadora\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: El jugador objetivo muele X cartas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en el cementerio de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras gira, voces muertas gritan en una cacofonía creciente, desbaratando la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5b6daa5-3aa5-406b-8e33-839bf8c35bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 586702}, \'multiverseid\': 586702}, {\'name\': \'Pierre psalmodiante\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T} : Un joueur ciblé meule X cartes, X étant le nombre de cartes dans le cimetière de ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Quand elle tourne sur elle-même, elle déclenche une cacophonie grandissante de voix mortes, puissante au point de déchirer l\'esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'565b32ca-7e7d-4e05-bd6d-69092b389c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 586765}, \'multiverseid\': 586765}, {\'name\': \'Pietra del Lamento\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: Un giocatore bersaglio macina X carte, dove X è il numero di carte nel cimitero di quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando gira, le voci dei morti urlano in una cacofonia crescente, facendo a pezzi la mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44e6a94b-b487-4a7f-a874-aff64f601c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 586828}, \'multiverseid\': 586828}, {\'name\': \'号泣の石\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を切削する。Ｘはそのプレイヤーの墓地にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その回転が生み出す死の叫び声は増し続ける不協和音となり、精神をずたずたに粉砕する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab23dd23-94e1-4757-84b5-dbfa8fe543b9\', \'multiverseId\': 586891}, \'multiverseid\': 586891}, {\'name\': \'Pedra Lamuriante\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: O jogador alvo tritura X cards, sendo X o número de cards no cemitério daquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme ela gira, as vozes dos mortos gritam numa crescente cacofonia capaz de dilacerar a mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b215a66e-1157-441e-bc3a-47c73b427c76\', \'multiverseId\': 587017}, \'multiverseid\': 587017}, {\'name\': \'恸哭石\', \'text\': \'{5}，{T}：目标牌手磨X张牌，X为该牌手坟墓场中牌的数量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它转动的尖削杂音有如不断增强的亡者之声，让心灵为之裂解。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd2e6178-fa4d-4cee-b5ef-1fd6d0b7348c\', \'multiverseId\': 587143}, \'multiverseid\': 587143}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klagender Stein\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl millt X Karten, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten im Friedhof jenes Spielers ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der neue Prototyp mit Drehachse ist wunderbar effektiv: Hätte Lust, mir damit selbst die Ohren abzureißen."\\n—Ashnod, an ihre Assistenten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587332&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf9c709c-251b-4763-9882-da435310ded6\', \'multiverseId\': 587332}, \'multiverseid\': 587332}, {\'name\': \'Piedra atormentadora\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: El jugador objetivo muele X cartas, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en el cementerio de ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El nuevo prototipo con eje giratorio funciona de maravilla: me dan ganas de arrancarme las orejas".\\n—Ashnod, a sus asistentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e174a8e7-9f76-400c-ab0c-ccff00681616\', \'multiverseId\': 587395}, \'multiverseid\': 587395}, {\'name\': \'Pierre psalmodiante\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T} : Un joueur ciblé meule X cartes, X étant le nombre de cartes dans le cimetière de ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Le nouveau prototype équipé d\'un axe de rotation est d\'une efficacité remarquable : il me donne envie de m\'arracher les oreilles. »\\n—Ashnod, à ses assistants", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b0208e4-6fa3-4a1f-8341-21aeb68702f4\', \'multiverseId\': 587458}, \'multiverseid\': 587458}, {\'name\': \'Pietra del Lamento\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: Un giocatore bersaglio macina X carte, dove X è il numero di carte nel cimitero di quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Grazie all\\\'asse rotazionale, il nuovo prototipo ha una straordinaria efficacia: mi fa venire voglia di strapparmi le orecchie."\\n—Ashnod ai suoi assistenti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ebf9e53-5d8e-4547-8354-7badc1d12022\', \'multiverseId\': 587521}, \'multiverseid\': 587521}, {\'name\': \'号泣の石\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードＸ枚を切削する。Ｘはそのプレイヤーの墓地にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「回転軸を用いたこの新しい試作品は驚くべき効果を示しているわね。自分でも鼓膜を引きちぎりたくなるぐらい。」\\n――アシュノッドから助手へ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e07fec-1d96-449a-866e-c40ab39c438b\', \'multiverseId\': 587584}, \'multiverseid\': 587584}, {\'name\': \'Pedra Lamuriante\', \'text\': \'{5}, {T}: O jogador alvo tritura X cards, sendo X o número de cards no cemitério daquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O novo protótipo com eixo rotacional é maravilhosamente eficaz: ele me faz querer arrancar os ouvidos."\\n— Ashnod, a assistentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c85c46-1ab8-49a8-aac1-83644cabcb43\', \'multiverseId\': 587710}, \'multiverseid\': 587710}, {\'name\': \'恸哭石\', \'text\': \'{5}，{T}：目标牌手磨X张牌，X为该牌手坟墓场中牌的数量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这台用旋转轴制成的试作品简直太有效了：我现在恨不得把自己耳朵扯下来。」\\n～阿士诺告诉助手\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ccf06c-003e-49c6-8d1f-eddb8f38bc13\', \'multiverseId\': 587773}, \'multiverseid\': 587773}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochensäge\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'In einer Welt, in der der Tod immer gewaltsam ist, sind grausame Waffen so gewöhnlich wie Steine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586620&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ee451d8-ea8f-4aa7-9760-24d41b9433bf\', \'multiverseId\': 586620}, \'multiverseid\': 586620}, {\'name\': \'Sierra de hueso\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'En un mundo donde la muerte es siempre violenta, las armas crueles son comunes como rocas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee91900f-694e-4446-a5fb-a90789f774ad\', \'multiverseId\': 586683}, \'multiverseid\': 586683}, {\'name\': "Scie d\'os", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/+0.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Dans un monde où la mort est toujours violente, les armes cruelles sont aussi courantes que les pierres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5083a50c-2c9c-47d6-8c0d-75125f32baed\', \'multiverseId\': 586746}, \'multiverseid\': 586746}, {\'name\': "Sega d\'Osso", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'In un mondo dove la morte è sempre violenta, le armi crudeli sono comuni quanto i sassi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b46ad35-c2b7-4472-a267-db5c077dd682\', \'multiverseId\': 586809}, \'multiverseid\': 586809}, {\'name\': \'骨の鋸\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'死が常に暴力によるものである世界では、残忍な武器は岩と同じぐらいありふれたものだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a81e9181-a1f3-4987-adbc-3e1037b2fa34\', \'multiverseId\': 586872}, \'multiverseid\': 586872}, {\'name\': \'Serra Óssea\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+0.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Em um mundo onde a morte sempre é violenta, armas cruéis são comuns como pedras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05b45a28-fd6f-4422-a0d7-9a7f7f516ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 586998}, \'multiverseid\': 586998}, {\'name\': \'白骨锯\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'在死状向来惨烈的世界中，各式残酷武器就如石头般四处可见。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc755b7f-4a9e-40f4-884e-a36eac207c24\', \'multiverseId\': 587124}, \'multiverseid\': 587124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochensäge\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Sollten keine Metallinstrumente verfügbar sein, genügt für eine Kraniektomie eine Säge, die aus dem Oberschenkelknochen des Patienten hergestellt wurde."\\n—Aus Ashnods Forschungsnotizen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587313&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c0bbc2-98af-4232-99c2-34e818814c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 587313}, \'multiverseid\': 587313}, {\'name\': \'Sierra de hueso\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"En caso de que falten instrumentos de metal, una sierra construida con el fémur del sujeto servirá para una craniectomía".\\n—Ashnod, notas de investigación\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771a18da-7ef6-4720-a755-644e243a06e3\', \'multiverseId\': 587376}, \'multiverseid\': 587376}, {\'name\': "Scie d\'os", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/+0.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'« Lorsque les instruments de métal sont rares, une scie fabriquée à partir du fémur du sujet suffira pour une craniectomie. »\\n—Ashnod, notes de recherche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76450473-a0de-4d22-bed5-581b8577a6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 587439}, \'multiverseid\': 587439}, {\'name\': "Sega d\'Osso", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"In mancanza di strumenti in metallo, una sega costruita utilizzando il femore del soggetto sarà sufficiente per effettuare una craniectomia."\\n—Ashnod, note di ricerca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ed32ec-e6ee-4a32-b716-60f93e495133\', \'multiverseId\': 587502}, \'multiverseid\': 587502}, {\'name\': \'骨の鋸\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「金属器具が不足しているときは、被験体の大腿骨から鋸を拵えること。開頭手術であれば十分だろう。」\\n――アシュノッドの研究メモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c177d179-f65b-43d9-a9ab-c56283d8594c\', \'multiverseId\': 587565}, \'multiverseid\': 587565}, {\'name\': \'Serra Óssea\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+0.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Na ausência de instrumentos metálicos, uma serra construída com o fêmur do espécime será suficiente para uma craniectomia."\\n— Ashnod, observações de pesquisa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58127399-f43e-4b8d-9b60-6aed458452aa\', \'multiverseId\': 587691}, \'multiverseid\': 587691}, {\'name\': \'白骨锯\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「缺乏金属器具时，也可用实验对象大腿骨制成的锯子来切除颅骨。」\\n～阿士诺，研究纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb05d174-8ad9-41dd-8d4c-93420080adc4\', \'multiverseId\': 587754}, \'multiverseid\': 587754}]', "[{'name': 'Laterne des Seelenführers', 'text': 'Wenn die Laterne des Seelenführers ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n{T}, opfere die Laterne des Seelenführers: Schicke die Friedhöfe aller Gegner ins Exil.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Laterne des Seelenführers: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586667&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2679f185-2013-4501-8dcc-1954b7cf8b77', 'multiverseId': 586667}, 'multiverseid': 586667}, {'name': 'Farol guía de almas', 'text': 'Cuando el Farol guía de almas entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Farol guía de almas: Exilia el cementerio de cada oponente.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Farol guía de almas: Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586730&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82eb012b-eae8-482d-8503-560aaabdebbb', 'multiverseId': 586730}, 'multiverseid': 586730}, {'name': 'Lanterne guide-âmes', 'text': 'Quand la Lanterne guide-âmes arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Lanterne guide-âmes : Exilez le cimetière de chaque adversaire.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Lanterne guide-âmes : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586793&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53123b57-b71d-4f0e-9f3d-81e6379d01ce', 'multiverseId': 586793}, 'multiverseid': 586793}, {'name': 'Lanterna Guidaspiriti', 'text': 'Quando la Lanterna Guidaspiriti entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Lanterna Guidaspiriti: Esilia il cimitero di ogni avversario.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Lanterna Guidaspiriti: Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586856&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02b3dc44-3428-44a9-ba8a-2c90cda1da41', 'multiverseId': 586856}, 'multiverseid': 586856}, {'name': '魂標ランタン', 'text': '魂標ランタンが戦場に出たとき、墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n{T}, 魂標ランタンを生け贄に捧げる：各対戦相手の墓地をそれぞれ追放する。\\n{1}, {T}, 魂標ランタンを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=586919&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0604d98f-bae5-4575-ae17-0c48b4c374a7', 'multiverseId': 586919}, 'multiverseid': 586919}, {'name': 'Lanterna Guia-almas', 'text': 'Quando Lanterna Guia-almas entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card alvo de um cemitério.\\n{T}, sacrifique Lanterna Guia-almas: Exile o cemitério de cada oponente.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Lanterna Guia-almas: Compre um card.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587045&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fec23688-ca61-4579-b223-939b27dd90ff', 'multiverseId': 587045}, 'multiverseid': 587045}, {'name': '导灵明灯', 'text': '当导灵明灯进战场时，将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。\\n{T}，牺牲导灵明灯：放逐每位对手的坟墓场。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲导灵明灯：抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587171&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02306ff6-f3c1-4f29-a623-c62261110f46', 'multiverseId': 587171}, 'multiverseid': 587171}]", "[{'name': 'Laterne des Seelenführers', 'text': 'Wenn die Laterne des Seelenführers ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n{T}, opfere die Laterne des Seelenführers: Schicke die Friedhöfe aller Gegner ins Exil.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Laterne des Seelenführers: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587360&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '180ef9a7-8556-4827-98c4-f2d5b65c1435', 'multiverseId': 587360}, 'multiverseid': 587360}, {'name': 'Farol guía de almas', 'text': 'Cuando el Farol guía de almas entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Farol guía de almas: Exilia el cementerio de cada oponente.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Farol guía de almas: Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587423&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '001151d0-7f77-4718-8d9f-5f1564cb9c96', 'multiverseId': 587423}, 'multiverseid': 587423}, {'name': 'Lanterne guide-âmes', 'text': 'Quand la Lanterne guide-âmes arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Lanterne guide-âmes : Exilez le cimetière de chaque adversaire.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Lanterne guide-âmes : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=587486&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallI